  <para style="h">Ivyakozwe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ivyakozwe n’Intumwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ivyakozwe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ivk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ivyakozwe n’Intumwa</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Intangamarara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Yewe Teyofilo, mu gitabu ca mbere nanditse, navuze ivyo Yesu yakoze n’ivyo yigishije vyose kuva mu ntango y’igikorwa ciwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />gushika ku musi yurizwa mw’ijuru, ahejeje kwongera kubwira intumwa yari yaratoranije ibizokurikira, ku bw’ubushobozi bwa Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Inyuma y’urupfu rwiwe, yamaze imisi mirongo ine aja ariyereka izo ntumwa, azereka ibemenyetso bigaragaza ko ari muzima, yongera ababwira ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Umusi umwe, ariko asangira na bo, yababwiye ashimitse ati: <char style="wj">“Ntimuve i Yerusalemu, ariko murindire gushika Data abarungikiye ingabire yabasezeraniye, imwe nababwira.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><char style="wj">Yohana yabatiza mu mazi, ariko mu gihe gito, mwebwe muzobatizwa muri Mpwemu Yera.”</char><verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Abari bakoraniye hamwe na we baramubaza bati: “Mwami, none ubu ni ho ugomba ugarukane ya ngoma ya Isirayeli?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Arabishura ati: <char style="wj">“Si ivyanyu kumenya ivy’ibihe canke imisi Data yashinze; ivyo biri mu bubasha bwiwe wenyene.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><char style="wj">Ariko mwebwe muzohabwa ubushobozi Mpwemu Yera niyabazako; maze muzonshingira intahe i Yerusalemu, i Yudaya n’i Samariya hose, no gushika ku mpera z’isi.”</char><verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Ahejeje kubabwira ivyo, aca aduzwa mw’ijuru bamuraba, haza igicu kiramupfuka, ntibaba bakimubona.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bakirangamije mu kirere baraba ingene aduga, haboneka abagabo babiri bambaye amakanzu zera, bahagarara i ruhande yabo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Barababaza bati: “Yemwe bagabo b’i Galilaya, ni kuki muhagaze ngaha muraba mw’ijuru? Uwu Yesu akuwe muri mwebwe akajanwa mw’ijuru, azogaruka uko nyene mumubonye agenda.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matiyasi asubirira Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Nuko baca bava kuri uwo Musozi wa Elayono, basubira i Yerusalemu, ni nk’urugendo rwemewe ku musi w’Isabato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilometero 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Bashitse, baca baja mu cumba co hejuru, ico bari bamazemwo imisi, na bo ni aba:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:13" />
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Petero, Yohana, Yakobo, Andereya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Filipo, Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Baruteremi, Matayo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ACT 1:13">Yakobo mwene Alufayo, Simoni Umuzelote, na Yuda mwene Yakobo.<verse eid="ACT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bose bakoranira hamwe bahuje umutima n’inama mu masengesho, bari kumwe na Mariya nyina wa Yesu n’abandi bagore, hamwe na bene nyina ba Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Muri iyo misi, Petero ahagarara hagati y’abo bene Data (bashika nk’ijana na mirongo ibiri), <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />arababwira ati: “Bene Data, Ivyanditswe vyategerezwa gushika kuri Yuda, umwe yaza arongoye abaje gufata Yesu. Ivyo Mpwemu Yera yari yarabivuze kera aciye kuri Dawidi. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda yari umwe muri twebwe, kandi twari dusangiye igikorwa.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Ingero Yuda yahawe kubera ikibi yakoze yaguzwemwo itongo kandi ni ryo yaguyemwo, akoroka atanguje umutwe, inda yiwe irasaba, amara arasanzara. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Ababa i Yerusalemu bose baramenye iyo nkuru, baca bita iryo tongo Akelodama, bisobanurwa ngo: Itongo ry’amaraso.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Petero avuga ati: “Mu gitabu ca Zaburi handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘I muhira iwe haze habe umusaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">ntihagire n’umwe azohaba.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Zaburi 69:25</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Kandi ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Aze asubirizwe mu mabanga yiwe y’uburongozi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 109:8">Zaburi 109:8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ni co gituma dukwiye gutora umwe mu bo twabanye mu gihe cose Umwami Yesu yagendanye natwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />uhereye igihe yabatizwa na Yohana, gushika igihe yaduzwa mw’ijuru. Uwo azoheza abe icabona kimwe muri twebwe co gushingira intahe ukuzuka kwiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Nuko baca batanga amazina y’abantu babiri ngo batoremwo umwe. Umwe yari Yosefu bita Barusaba (akongera akitwa Yusito), uwundi yari Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Nuko barasenga, bavuga bati: “Ewe Mwami Imana, ni wewe uzi imitima y’aba bantu bose. None rero niwerekane uwo utoranije muri aba babiri, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kugira ngo abandanye iki gikorwa c’intumwa, ico Yuda yataye akaja ukwiwe.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Nuko bagira ubupfindo, Matiyasi aba ari we atorwa, aca yongerwa kuri bamwe cumi n’umwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mpwemu Yera aza ku ntumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Ku musi wa Pentekote, abizera bose bari bakoraniye hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ubwo nyene haza igihinda kivuye mw’ijuru kimeze nk’umuyaga mwinshi w’igihuhusi, cuzura mu nzu barimwo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Baca babona ibimeze nk’imbeya z’umuriro zitandukanije, zigenda zija kuri umwumwe wese mu bari ngaho bose. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bose baca buzura Mpwemu Yera, batangura kuvuga mu zindi ndimi nk’uko Mpwemu Yera abashoboje kuzivuga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Kandi hariho Abayuda benshi bubaha Imana bari i Yerusalemu, bari ngaho bavuye mu mahanga atandukanye ari kw’isi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Bumvise ukwo guhinda, bose baca birukira aho hantu, baratangara cane kuko umwe wese yumva abizera bavuga ururimi rwiwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Mu gutangara bakabazanya bati: “Aba bantu bose bariko baravuga si Abanyagalilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />None bigenda gute ngo umwumwe wese muri twebwe abumve bavuga ururimi kavukire rw’iwe? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Muri twebwe harimwo Abapariti, Abamedi, Abelamiti, n’abava i Mezopotamiya, i Yudaya i Kapadokiya, i Ponto, muri Aziya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />i Furugiya, i Pamfiliya, muri Egiputa no mu gice ca Libiya cegereye i Kurene, n’abavuye i Roma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(bagizwe n’Abayuda n’abinjiye mw’idini ry’Abayuda), Abanyakireti, n’Abarabu. Kandi twese tubumva bavuga ibitangaza vy’Imana mu ndimi z’iwacu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Nuko bose barumirwa bongera barazazanirwa, babazanya bati: “Mbega ibi ni iki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ariko bamwe barabacokora bavuga bati: “Aba bantu baborewe, banyoye igisama.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero yigisha isinzi ry’abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Petero aca arahaguruka ari kumwe na bamwe cumi n’umwe, avuga n’ijwi rirenga abwira abari ngaho ati: “Bayuda benewacu, namwe mwese muri i Yerusalemu, nimuntege amatwi, mutahure neza ibibaye. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aba bantu ntibaborewe nk’uko bamwe muvyiyumvira. Raba haracari isaha zitatu z’igitondo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ibi ni ivyari vyaravuzwe n’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yoweli, aho yavuga ati:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Uku ni ko Imana ivuze, iti: Mu bihe vya nyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">nzosuka Mpwemu wanje ku bantu bose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">abahungu banyu n’abakobwa banyu bazovugishwa nanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">n’abasore banyu bazobona ivyo beretswe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">abatama banyu bazorota inzozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />N’abasavyi banje, abagabo n’abagore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">muri iyo misi nzobasukako Mpwemu wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kandi bazovugishwa nanje.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nzokwerekana ibitangaza hejuru kw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">n’ibimenyetso hasi kw’isi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">amaraso, umuriro, n’ugupfunduka kw’umwotsi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Izuba rizohinduka umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ukwezi guhinduke amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">imbere y’ukuza kwa wa musi w’Uhoraho uhambaye kandi w’ubwiza.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kandi umuntu wese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">azokwambaza izina ry’Uhoraho azokizwa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Yoweli 2:28-32</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Yemwe Bisirayeli, Yesu w’i Nazareti yari umuntu yashingiwe intahe n’Imana mu bitangaza, utwumiza n’ibimenyetso Imana yamukoresheje muri mwebwe, nk’uko ubwanyu mubizi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Uwo Yesu yatanzwe mu maboko yanyu ku bw’umugambi Imana yari yatareguye kuva kera, maze namwe mufashijwe n’abanyakibi n’abanyamahanga, mumwica mumubamvye ku musaraba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ariko Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye, imukura mu vyara vy’urupfu, kuko bitashoboka ko urupfu rumugumya. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dawidi yaramuvuzeko ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Namye nshize amaso yanje k’Uhoraho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Aho ari i buryo bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">sinzonyiganyizwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ni co gituma umutima wanje unezerewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ururimi rwanje rugahimbarwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">n’umubiri wanje ukaruhukana ivyizigiro,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kuko utazorekera umushaha wanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">mu kibanza c’abapfuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">canke ngo uze ureke uwera wawe ngo abore.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wamenyesheje inzira y’ubugingo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">uzonyuzuza umunezero ndi imbere yawe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Zaburi 16:8-11</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Bene Data, ndashobora kubabwira ntakekeranya ko sogokuruza wacu Dawidi yapfuye agahambwa, kandi n’imva yiwe iracari hano gushika n’uwu musi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Yari umuvugishwa n’Imana kandi yari azi ko Imana yari yaramusezeraniye ishizeko n’indahiro ko izokwimika ku ngoma yiwe umwe mu ruvyaro rwiwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Yeretswe ibizoba muri kazoza, avuga ivy’ukuzuka kwa Kristo, ko atazorekerwa i kuzimu mu kibanza c’abapfuye, kandi ko n’umubiri wiwe utazobora. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Uwo Yesu Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye, twese turi ivyabona vyo kubishingira intahe. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />None rero, amaze gushika i buryo bw’Imana, yakiriye Mpwemu Yera, uwo Data yari yarasezeranye, amusuka kuri twebwe. Nk’uko muriko murabibona kandi muvyumva. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dawidi ntiyaduze mw’ijuru, ariko ni we yavuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Uhoraho yabariye Umwami wanje ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Icara i buryo bwanje<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kugeza abansi bawe bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">ndabashize musi y’ibirenge vyawe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zaburi 110:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Nuko rero Abisirayeli nibamenye ukuri badakekeranya ko uwo Yesu, uwo mwebwe mwabamvye, Imana yamugize Umwami na Kristo.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Abari ngaho bose bavyumvise bibacumita mu mitima, babaza Petero n’izindi ntumwa bati: “Bagabo benewacu, dukore iki?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petero arabishura ati: “Umuntu wese muri mwebwe niyihane, abatizwe mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo, kugira ngo ivyaha vyanyu bibone guharirwa, ni ho muzoronka ingabire ya Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kuko iryo sezerano ari iryanyu, n’abana banyu, n’abari kure bose, abazohamagarwa n’Umwami Imana yacu bose.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petero aca abandanya ababwira ayandi majambo menshi yo kubinginga no kubahanura, avuga ati: “Nimuhunge uru runganwe rw’inkozi z’ibibi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Nuko abizeye ayo majambo ya Petero barabatizwa, abashika ibihumbi bitatu biyongera ku gitigiri c’abizera.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uko abizera bari babayeho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Maze abizera bose bashishikara gushira imitima ku vyo intumwa zigisha, gusangira ivyabo, kumanyagura imikate, no gusenga. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Umuntu wese aterwa n’ubwoba ku bw’ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso vyinshi vyakorwa n’intumwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Abizera bose baba hamwe kandi bagasangira ivyabo vyose. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bagurisha amatongo n’ivyo batunze vyose, bakagabura amahera, bakurikije ubukene bw’umwumwe wese. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Imisi yose bama bakoranira mu rusengero, bakamanyagurira imikate mu mihana yabo, bakongera bagasangirira hamwe bafise imitima ihuye kandi banezerewe. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bama bashima Imana ibihe vyose kandi na bo bagashimwa n’abantu bose, maze Umwami Imana na we akama abongerereza igitigiri c’abakizwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petero akiza ikimuga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Umusi umwe Petero na Yohana bari baduze mu rusengero gusenga, hari kw’isaha y’icenda. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Hariho umuntu yavutse amugaye, bakama imisi yose bamujana bakamushira kw’irembo ry’urusengero ryitwa Irembo Ryiza kugira ngo asege abaje mu rusengero. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Abonye Petero na Yohana bagira binjire mu rusengero, arabasega. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Maze Petero na Yohana barahindukira baramuraba, hanyuma Petero amubwira ati: “Nuturabe!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Uwo muntu aca abahanga amaso cane yiteze ko hari ico bagira bamuhe.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Ariko Petero aca amubwira ati: “Ifeza n’inzahabu nta vyo mfise, ariko ico mfise ndakiguhaye. Mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo w’i Nazareti, va hasi utambuke!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Aca amufata ukuboko kw’i buryo, aramuhagurutsa, ubwo nyene ibirenge vyiwe n’ingingo zavyo bica birakomera. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nuko aca atangura gutambuka, yinjirana na bo mu rusengero, atambuka neza, yiterera hejuru, ahimbaza Imana. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Abantu bose bamubonye agendagenda ashima Imana, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />bamenya ko ari umwe yahora yama yicara kw’irembo ry’urusengero ryitwa Irembo Ryiza asegerereza. Barumirwa cane, batangajwe n’ibihejeje kumubako.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero yigisha mu rusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Kubera ko wa muntu yaguma afashe Petero na Yohana, abantu bose biruka iyo bari, barundana mw’ibaraza ryitwa Ibaraza rya Salomo, batangaye cane. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petero abibonye, arababwira ati: “Yemwe Bisirayeli, ni kubera iki ibi bibatangaje? Ni kubera iki muturaba nk’aho umenga ni ubushobozi bwacu canke ukwubaha Imana kwacu kwatumye uwu muntu atambuka? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Imana ya Aburahamu, ya Isaka na Yakobo, Imana ya ba sogokuruza, ni yo ihesheje icubahiro umusavyi wayo Yesu, uwo mwanse, mukamushikiriza Pilato ngo yicwe, naho we yari yahisemwo kumurekura. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Mwihakanye Uwera, Umugororotsi, musaba ko barekura umwicanyi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mwishe uwutanga ubugingo, ariko Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye, twebwe turi ivyabona vyo kubishingira intahe. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ni kubwo kwizera izina rya Yesu, uwu muntu mubona kandi muzi yakize. Ni kubwo kwizera Yesu n’izina ryiwe vyamukijije neza nk’uko namwe mwese muvyibonera.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />None rero bavukanyi, ndazi ko mwabikoze mu kutamenya, co kimwe n’abatware banyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ariko uko ni ko Imana yashikije ivyo yari yaravugiye mu kanwa k’abavugishwa na yo bose, ivuga ko Kristo akwiye kubabazwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Nuko rero nimwihane, muhindukire, kugira ngo ivyaha vyanyu bihanagurwe, ngo ibihe vy’impemburo bibone ingene biza, bivuye imbere y’Umwami Imana, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />maze yongere ibarungikire uwo yabasezeraniye ngo ababere Kristo, ari we Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Uwo akwiye kuguma mw’ijuru kugeza igihe Imana izohindurira ibintu vyose bikaba bisha, nk’uko yabivuze kera ikoresheje abavugishwa bayo bera. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Kuko Mose yavuze ati: ‘Uhoraho Imana yanyu azobahagurukiriza uwuvugishwa n’Imana ameze nkanje, imukuye muri mwebwe nyene. Muze mumwumvire mu vyo azobabwira vyose. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Uwutazomwumvira aze arandurwe mu bwoko bwiwe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Gusubiramwo 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Kandi, n’abandi bavugishwa n’Imana bose uhereye kuri Samweli, baravugishijwe ku biriko biraba uno musi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Muri abuzukuruza b’abo bavugishwa b’Imana, n’abana b’isezerano iyo Mana yagiranye na ba sogokuruza banyu. Yabwiye Aburahamu iti: ‘Mu ruvyaro rwawe ni ho imiryango yose yo mw’isi izohererwa umugisha.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Itanguriro 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Imana yazura umusavyi wayo, maze ica ibanza kumutuma kuri mwebwe, kugira ngo umwe wese muri mwebwe ahabwe umugisha mu kuva mu nzira ziwe mbi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petero na Yohana barengutswa imbere y’Inama Nkuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Abaherezi bari kumwe n’umukuru w’abarinzi b’urusengero hamwe n’Abasadukayo baca baja aho Petero na Yohana bariko barigishiziza. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bari bashavujwe cane n’uko izo ntumwa zariko zigisha abantu, zibabwira ivyo kuzuka kw’abapfuye kubonerwa muri Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Baca bafata Petero na Yohana, kandi kubera bwari bwije, babashira mw’ibohero gushika bukeye. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ariko benshi mu bumvise ubutumwa bavuze bari bizeye, igitigiri c’abizera kirongerekana gushika hafi ibihumbi bitanu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Bukeye, abatware, abakuru n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe bakoranira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Anasi umuherezi mukuru ni ho yari ari, ari kumwe na Kayafa, na Yohana, na Alegizandere hamwe n’abandi benshi bo mu muryango w’abaherezi bakuru. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Nuko barengutsa Petero na Yohana, babashira hagati, baca batangura kubabazagiza bati: “Ni ubushobozi nyabaki mwakoresheje, canke ni mw’izina rya nde mwakoze ivyo?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Maze Petero, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, aca ababwira ati: “Batware nanwe bashingatahe b’ubu bwoko, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />uwu musi turiko turasambishwa kubera igikorwa ciza cakorewe ikimuga, tubazwa n’ingene cakize. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Nuko rero mwese nimumenye neza ibi, mwebwe ubwanyu hamwe n’ubwoko bwose bw’Abisirayeli: uwu muntu ahagaze imbere yanyu yakize mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo w’i Nazareti, uwo mwabamvye, ariko Imana ikamuzura mu bapfuye. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ni we</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘buye ryatawe n’abubatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ariko ryahindutse irigumya imfuruka.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zaburi 118:22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Nta wundi agakiza karonkerwamwo, atari we, kuko ata rindi zina twahawe musi y’ijuru ryo gukirizwamwo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Babonye ubushizi bw’amanga bwari muri Petero na Yohana, bakamenya ko batize, ahubwo ko ari abantu batobato, baratangara cane, ariko bamenya ko bagendanye na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kandi kubera babona uwo muntu yakize ahagararanye na bo, nta co bari bafise bashobora gusubizayo. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Nuko barabataramura, batangura kuvugana hagati yabo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Barabazanya bati: “Mbega aba bantu tubagire dute? Abantu bose baba i Yerusalemu barazi ko bakoze igitangaza kigaragara neza, kandi natwe ntidushobora kubihakana. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ariko kugira tubuze ibi bintu kubandanya vyamamara mu bantu, reka tubabuze kubandanya bigisha muri iryo zina rya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nuko barabahamagara, babihanikiriza ngo ntibaze bahirahire ngo bongere kuvuga canke kwigisha mw’izina rya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Maze Petero na Yohana barabishura bati: “Mbega mubona ko ikibereye mu nyonga z’Imana, ari kwubaha mwebwe canke ari kwubaha iyo Mana? Gira ico mubitubwiyeko! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kuko twebwe ntidushobora kureka kuvuga ivyo twiboneye kandi twiyumviye.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nuko babanza kubatera ubwoba cane, hanyuma barabarekura barataha, bamaze kubura ingene bobahana; kubera abari ngaho bose bariko bashima Imana ku vyabaye. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Uwo muntu yari yakize mu buryo bw’igitangaza yari afise imyaka irenga mirongo ine.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abizera basenga basaba gushira amanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Petero na Yohana bamaze kurekurwa baca basubira aho bagenzi babo bari, babiganira ivyo abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abakuru bababwiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bavyumvise, bose baca bashira amajwi yabo hejuru, basenga Imana, bavuga bati: “Mwami Imana uganje vyose, ni wewe waremye ijuru, isi n’ikiyaga, n’ibibibamwo vyose. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ni wewe wavuze biciye kuri Mpwemu Yera, no mu kanwa k’umusavyi wawe, sogokuruza Dawidi, uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Ni kuki amahanga yuzuye uburake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">kandi ni kuki bategura imigambi ata co ishobora gushikako?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Abami bo mw’isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">bakuye hasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">n’abatware bagiye hamwe ngo bagwanye Uhoraho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">n’uwo yarobanuje amavuta.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Zaburi 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ni mu vy’ukuri ivyo vyarabaye, Herode Antipa, Pontiyo Pilato, Abanyamahanga hamwe n’ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli bo muri iki gisagara, barifatanije kugira ngo bagwanye umusavyi wawe yera Yesu, uwo warobanuje amavuta. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Ariko bashikije ico wari waramaze kugena ko kizoshika, mu bushobozi bwawe no mu gushaka kwawe. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />None rero Mwami Imana, nurabe ingene badutera ubwoba, maze ushoboze abasavyi bawe kwigisha ijambo ryawe bashize amanga rwose. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Gorora ukuboko kwawe maze ukize ingwara, ukore ibitangaza n’utwumiza mw’izina ry’umusavyi wawe yera Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bahejeje gusenga, aho bari bakoraniye haratigita, bose buzuzwa Mpwemu Yera, baca bigisha ijambo ry’Imana bashize amanga rwose.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abizera basangira ivyabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Abizera bose bari bahuje umutima n’inama muri vyose. Nta n’umwe yavuga ko ivyo atunze ari ivyiwe wenyene, ariko basangira ivyo bafise vyose. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Intumwa zabandanya gushingira intahe ukuzuka kw’Umwami Yesu zuzuye ubushobozi bwinshi, kandi ubuntu bw’Imana bwinshi bwaguma bugwira kuri bo bose. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Nta n’umwe yagira ico akeheje muri bo, kuko abari bafise amatongo canke amazu, babigurisha bakazana amahera vyaguzwe, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />bakayashikiriza intumwa, maze na zo zikayabagabanganya, umwumwe wese akaronka ayakwiranye n’ivyo akenye.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Nk’akarorero, Yosefu, Umulewi yava i Kupuro, uwo intumwa zise Baranaba (risobanura ngo Umuntu atera intege), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />yagurishije itongo ryiwe aca azana amahera yose yarigurishije, ayashikiriza intumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyabaye kuri Ananiya na Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ariko hariho umugabo yitwa Ananiya, yari afise umugore yitwa Safira. Bagurisha itongo ryabo babigiye inama. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Aca yumvikana n’uwo mugore wiwe, bafata igice c’amahera bakuyemwo barakinyegeza, igice kindi aba ari co bajana bagishira imbere y’ibirenge vy’intumwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Maze Petero abaza Ananiya ati: “Ananiya, ni gute wemeye ko Satani yuzuza umutima wawe guhenda Mpwemu Yera mu kunyegeza igice c’amahera wagurishije itongo ryawe? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Mbega utararigurisha ntiryari iryawe? Kandi umaze kurigurisha, amahera ntiyari ayawe? Vyakugendeye gute ngo wiyumvire gukora ikintu nk’ico? Erega si twebwe wabeshe, ahubwo wabeshe Imana!”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiya acumva ivyo, agwa hasi arahwera. Abumvise ibibaye bose batekerwa n’ubwoba. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Maze abasore bari ngaho baca bava hasi, batekera ikiziga ciwe bakijana kugihamba.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Haciye nk’amasaha atatu umugore wiwe aca arashika, atazi ivyabaye. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petero aramubaza ati: “Mbwira! Aya ni amahera yose mwe na Ananiya mwakuye mw’itongo mwagurishije?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Safira amwishura ati: “Egome, ni ayo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petero aca amubwira ati: “Vyabagendeye gute ngo mwumvikane guhenda Mpwemu w’Umwami Imana? Raba ibirenge vy’abavuye guhamba umugabo wawe bigeze aho imbere y’umuryango, kandi nawe barakujana.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ubwo nyene aca agwa hasi imbere y’ibirenge vya Petero, aracikana. Ba bantu baca barinjira, basanga na we arapfuye, baramufata baja kumuhamba, bamuryamika i ruhande y’umugabo wiwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Ishengero ryose n’abumvise ivyabaye bose baca bafatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zikiza abagwaye benshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Inyuma y’ivyo, intumwa zibandanya zikora ibitangaza n’utwumiza mu bantu, kandi abizera bose bama bahurira hamwe mw’ibaraza rya Salomo, bahuje umutima n’inama. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Nta n’umwe yubahuka kwifatanya na bo, n’aho abantu babemera cane. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ariko abantu benshi, abagabo n’abagore barizera Umwami, igitigiri cabo cama congerekana. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Vyatuma kandi abantu benshi bama bazana abagwaye bakabaryamika mu nderuzo no ku birago i ruhande y’inzira, kugira ngo Petero arenganye igitutu ciwe gipfume kibashikira. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Abantu isinzi bama bakorana bavuye mu mihana ikikuje Yerusalemu, bazanye abagwaye n’abafashwe n’impwemu mbi, kandi bose barakira.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zihamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Maze umuherezi mukuru n’abo bari bafadikanije, bari mu muce b’Abasadukayo, babagirira ishari ryinshi intumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Nuko barabafata babashira mw’ibohero. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ariko mw’ijoro, umumarayika w’Umwami Imana yugurura imiryango y’iryo bohero, arabasohora. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Maze arababwira ati: “Nimugende muhagarare mu rusengero, mubwire abantu ubutumwa bwuzuye bw’ivy’ubu bugingo bushasha.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bukeye binjira mu rusengero nk’uko babariwe, batangura kwigisha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Umuherezi mukuru n’abo bari bafatanije bashitse, baca bakoranya inama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli, bahejeje barungika abarinzi b’urusengero kw’ibohero kuzana za ntumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ariko abo barinzi b’urusengero bashitse kw’ibohero, ntibabasangayo, baca basubira inyuma gutanga inkuru, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />bavuga bati: “Twasanze ibohero ryugaye neza, n’abarinzi bahagaze ku miryango, ariko twuguruye twasanze ata muntu n’umwe yariyo.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Umukuru w’abarinzi b’urusengero n’abaherezi bakurubakuru bavyumvise barazazanirwa cane bibaza ibishobora gukurikira.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ubwo nyene haca haza umuntu, ababwira ati: “Ba bagabo mwashira mw’ibohero, bahagaze mu rusengero bariko barigisha abantu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Wa mukuru w’abarinzi b’urusengero aca ajana n’abarinzi bari kumwe, baja kuzana izo ntumwa. Ariko babazana ku neza badakoresheje inguvu, kuko batinya ko abantu bobatera amabuye.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Babashikanye, babashira imbere y’inama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko, maze umuherezi mukuru atangura kubasambisha. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Arababwira ati: “Twari twabihanikirije kutongera kwigisha muri iryo zina. Ariko mwakwiragije inyigisho zanyu i Yerusalemu hose, kandi mwamaramaje kutwegekako amaraso y’uwo muntu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petero n’izindi ntumwa barishura bati: “Dutegerezwa kwubaha Imana kuruta abantu! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Imana ya ba sogokuruza yazuye Yesu mu bapfuye, uwo mwari mwishe mumubamvye ku musaraba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Imana yaramushize hejuru imwicarika i buryo bwayo nk’Umutware n’Umukiza, kugira ngo ahe Abisirayeli ukwihana n’uguharirwa ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Ivyo twebwe turabishingira intahe, kandi na Mpwemu Yera arabishingira intahe, uwo Imana yahaye abamwumvira.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Bavyumvise barashangashirwa, bagomba kubicisha. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ariko hari Umufarisayo yitwa Gamaliyeli, yari umwigisha w’ivyagezwe, yubahwa cane n’abantu bose. Arahaguruka, asaba ko bataramura gatoya izo ntumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Aca abwira abagize inama nkuru y’Abayuda ati: “Bagabo bo muri Isirayeli, mwiyumvire neza ku vyo mugomba kugirira aba bantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mu misi iheze, uwitwa Teyuda yaje yigira uwuhambaye, abantu bashika amajana ane baramukurikira. Amaze kwicwa, abamukurikira bose baciye basanzara, ntibagira ico bashikako. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Inyuma yaho, Yuda Umunyagalilaya yaje mu misi yo gusansuma abantu, arongoye umugwi w’abantu bagumutse. Na we nyene yarishwe, abamukurikira barasanzara. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />None rero ku bw’aba bantu na bo, ndabahanure: Nimurekure aba bantu bigire! Kuko nimba ivyo bariko barakora vyavuye ku bantu, nta ho bizoshika. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ariko nimba biva ku Mana, ntimuzoshobora kubagwanya; ahubwo muzosanga muriko mugwanya Imana.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nuko bemera impanuro ziwe, bahamagaza za ntumwa, barazikubitisha, bazitegeka kudasubira kwigisha muri iryo zina rya Yesu, baca barabarekura barataha.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Izo ntumwa zica ziva imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko zinezerewe, kuko Imana yari yabonye ko bibabereye kubabazwa bahorwa izina rya Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Imisi yose bama mu rusengero canke mu mihana, ntibigeze bahagarika kwigisha no kwamamaza inkuru nziza, bavuga ko Yesu ari we Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zitoranya abo kugaburira abakene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Muri iyo misi, igitigiri c’abigishwa caguma ciyongera. Abayuda bavuga Ikigiriki bari muri bo bidogera Abayuda b’imvukira ko birengagiza abapfakazi babo iyo batanga imfungurwa zo ku musi ku musi. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Bamwe cumi na babiri baca bakoranira hamwe n’abandi bigishwa, bavuga bati: “Si vyiza ko dufata minenegwe igikorwa co kugabura ijambo ry’Imana bitumwe no kugabura ivyokurya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Bene Data, nimutoranye abantu indwi muri mwebwe, mushingira intahe ko buzuye Mpwemu Yera n’ubwenge, tubazeze ico gikorwa, <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />hanyuma natwe duheze twiyegurire igikorwa co gusenga no kwigisha Ijambo ry’Imana.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Abari ngaho bose bashima ico ciyumviro, maze batoranya Setefano, umuntu yari yuzuye ukwizera kandi yari yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, na Filipo, na Purokoro, Nikanori, Timoni, Parumena, na Nikola Umunyantiyokiya yinjiye mw’idini ry’Abayuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aya mazina yose avugwa hano ni ay’Abayuda bavuga Ikigiriki.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Nuko abo bantu bazanwa imbere y’intumwa, zirabasengera, zibarambitseko ibiganza.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Nuko ijambo ry’Imana ribandanya kwamamara, igitigiri c’abigishwa kiragwira cane i Yerusalemu, kandi n’abaherezi benshi bo mw’idini ry’Abayuda barizera.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Setefano Afatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Setefano yari umuntu yuzuye ubuntu n’ubushobozi vy’Imana, vyatuma akora ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso vyinshi imbere y’abantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Maze abantu bamwebamwe bo mw’Isinagogi y’abiyita Abahoze ari abagurano bidegemvya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abasengera muri iri sinagogi bari abagurano b’Abayuda bahawe umwidegemvyo.</char></note> ari bo Bayuda b’i Kurene n’abo muri Alegizanderiya, bafatanije n’abava mu ntara za Kilikiya na Aziya, bahagurukira rimwe guhaririza Setefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ariko ntibashobora guhagarara imbere y’ubwenge yahabwa na Mpwemu Yera iyo ariko aravuga.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ni ko guca baha ingero abantu mu mpisho ngo baje kumudodobereza bamurega bati: “Twumvise Setefano atuka Mose, yongera atuka n’Imana.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Maze baca bagumura abantu bose, harimwo n’abakuru b’ubwo bwoko n’abigisha b’ivyagezwe, bafata Setefano, bamutwara imbere y’inama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Baca bazana ibindi vyabona vy’ibinyoma, bavuga bati: “Uwu mugabo yama atuka urusengero rwera n’ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Twaramwumvise avuga ko uwo Yesu w’i Nazareti azosambura urusengero yongere ahindure imigenzo Mose yadusigiye.”<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Abari bicaye mu nama nkuru y’abarongoye ubwo bwoko bose bamwihweje, babona mu maso hiwe hasa n’ah’umumarayika.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Setefano yiregura imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Nuko umuherezi mukuru aramubaza ati: “Ivyo bakwagiriza ni vyo?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Na we amwishura ati: “Bavukanyi namwe bavyeyi, nimuntege amatwi ndababwire. Imana y’ubwiza yiyeretse sogokuruza Aburahamu akiri i Mesopotamiya, imbere y’uko aja kuba i Harani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Yamubwiye iti: ‘Va mu gihugu cawe no mu bwoko bwawe, uje mu gihugu nzokwereka.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Itanguriro 12:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Nuko Aburahamu ava mu gihugu c’Abakarudaya, aja kuba i Harani. Se wiwe amaze gupfa, Imana imurungika muri iki gihugu mubamwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nta mugabane yamuhaye muri ico gihugu, nta n’aho guhonyoza ikirenge, ariko Imana yamusezeraniye ko we n’uruvyaro rwiwe bazokwegukira iki gihugu, n’aho ico gihe Aburahamu atari bwaronke umwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Imana yamubwiye iti: ‘Uruvyaro rwawe ruzoba mu gihugu kitari icabo, bitwe abanyamahanga kandi bazogirwa abaja, bacinyizwe imyaka amajana ane.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Imana irongera kandi ivuga iti: ‘Ariko nzohana ihanga rizobagira abagurano, kandi mu nyuma bazorivamwo, baze kunsengera muri iki gihugu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Itanguriro 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nuko ica iha Aburahamu isezerano ryo gukebwa. Aburahamu na we avyara Isaka, amukeba ku musi ugira umunani. Isaka avyara Yakobo aramukeba, Yakobo na we avyara ba sogokuruza cumi na babiri, na we arabakeba.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Kubera ishari ba sogokuruza bagiriye Yosefu, baramugurishije muri Egiputa; ariko Imana yari kumwe na we, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />maze imukiza amarushwa yiwe yose. Imuha ubwenge budasanzwe n’ikiganza ciza kuri Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa, na we amuha ubutware kuri Egiputa yose no mu bakozi biwe.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Igihe kimwe inzara itera mu gihugu cose ca Egiputa n’i Kanani, abantu babona amakuba, ba sogokuruza babura ivyokurya. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yakobo yumvise ko muri Egiputa hariyo ingano, arungikayo ba sogokuruza incuro ya mbere. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Basubiyeyo ubwa kabiri, Yosefu yihishurira benewabo, Farawo na we abona kumenya umuryango wa Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Maze Yosefu aca atumako se Yakobo n’umuryango wiwe wose. Bose hamwe bari mirongo indwi na batanu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Nuko Yakobo amanuka muri Egiputa. Mu nyuma arapfa, co kimwe na ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Ibisigarira vyabo vyatahukanywe i Shekemu, bishingurwa mu mva ziri ahantu Aburahamu yari yaguriye abahungu ba Hamori i Shekemu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Igihe c’uko Imana ishitsa amasezerano yahaye Aburahamu cegereje, igitigiri c’ubwoko bwacu cari kimaze kugwira, kirongerekana cane muri Egiputa. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 1:8">Kuvayo 1:8</ref></char></char></note>Mu nyuma muri Egiputa himikwa uwundi mwami atigeze amenya ivya Yosefu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Akorera ikibi ubwoko bwacu, ategeka ba sogokuruza guta abana babo b’inzoya kugira ngo ntibabeho.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ico gihe ni ho Mose yavuka, avuka ari umwana adasanzwe imbere y’Imana. Nuko arererwa mu muryango wiwe gushika ashikanye amezi atatu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Amaze gutabwa, umukobwa wa Farawo aramutora, amurera nk’umwana wiwe bwite. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Nuko Mose yigishwa ubwenge bwose bw’Abanyegiputa, kandi aba uwuhambaye mu mvugo no mu ngiro.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Mose amaze imyaka mirongo ine, yumva mu mutima yotemberera benewabo b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Maze asanga Umunyegiputa ariko akubita Umwisirayeli, aca aramutabara, ndetse yica uwo Munyegiputa. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mose we yibaza ko benewabo baza gutahura ko Imana iriko iramukoresha mu kubakiza. Ariko Abisirayeli bo ntibabitahuye gutyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Bukeye Mose aragenda asanga Abisirayeli babiri bariko baragwana, aca agerageza kubumvikanisha, ababwira ati: ‘Mwa bagabo mwe, ko muri abavukanyi, ni iki gituma mugiriranira nabi?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Uwariko ararenganya mugenziwe aca asunura Mose, amubaza ati: ‘Ni nde yakugize umutware n’umucamanza wacu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ugomba kunyica nk’uko ejo wishe wa Munyegiputa?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kuvayo 2:14</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mose avyumvise, aca ahungira mu ntara ya Midiyani, abayo nk’umunyamahanga, avyarirayo abahungu babiri.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Haheze imyaka mirongo ine, umumarayika yiyereka Mose mu bugaragwa bw’Umusozi Sinayi, mu rubeya rw’umuriro wakira mu gisaka. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Maze Mose atangajwe n’ivyo abonye, yegera igisaka ngo arabe neza ivyo ari vyo, ni ho yumva ijwi ry’Umwami Imana rimubwira riti: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ndi Imana ya ba sogokuruza, Imana ya Aburahamu, ya Isaka, na Yakobo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kuvayo 3:6</ref></char></char></note> Mose ahinda agashitsi kubera ubwoba bwinshi, ntiyubahuka gusubira kwunamuka ngo arabe.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Umwami Imana aramubwira ati: ‘Ambura ibirato vyawe, kuko aha hantu uhagaze ari ahera. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nabonye agacinyizo abantu banje barimwo muri Egiputa, numva n’amaborogo yabo, none manukanywe no kubakiza. Rero nuze, ngomba kugutuma muri Egiputa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Kuvayo 3:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:8">8</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:10">10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Uwu ni Mose nyene bari baranse igihe bavuga bati: ‘Ni nde yakugize umutware n’umucamanza wacu?’ Imana ubwayo ni yo yamwirungikiye ngo abe umutware n’umucunguzi wabo, biciye ku mumarayika yamwiyeretse ari mu gisaka caka umuriro. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yabakuje muri Egiputa utwumiza n’ibitangaza yakoreye muri ico gihugu, ku kiyaga gitukura, no mu myaka mirongo ine bamaze mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Uwo Mose nyene ni we mu nyuma yabwiye Abisirayeli ati: ‘Imana izobahagurukiriza uwuvugishwa n’Imana ameze nkanje muri mwebwe.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Gusubiramwo 18:15</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Yari kumwe n’ikoraniro rya ba sogokuruza mu bugaragwa, igihe umumarayika yavuganira na we ku musozi Sinayi, agaca amuha amajambo y’ubugingo kugira ngo na we ayaduhe.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ariko ba sokuruza bacu baranse kumwumvira, bitandukanya na we, mu mitima yabo bipfuza kwisubirira muri Egiputa. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Maze babwira Aroni bati: ‘Ducurire imana zo kutuja imbere, kuko tutazi ivyashikiye Mose, uwadukuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kuvayo 32:1</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ico gihe ni ho bakora ikigirwamana mw’ishusho y’ishuri y’inka. Bagishikanira ibimazi bongera bagira umusi mukuru wo kwigina ico kintu bari bakoresheje amaboko yabo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Maze Imana ica irabareka ngo basenge izuba, ukwezi n’inyenyeri. Kandi ivyo bihuye n’ivyanditswe mu bitabu vy’abavugishwa n’Imana, bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Mbega ibimazi n’amashikanwa mwatanze mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">muri irya myaka mirongo ine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ni jewe mwabishikaniye ga yemwe Bisirayeli?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Oya, mwari mwitwaje ihema rya Moleki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moleki cari ikigirwamana c’Abanyakanani.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">n’ikimenyetso c’inyenyeri c’ikigirwamana canyu Refani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Refani na co cari ikigirwamana citiriwe isi bita Saturune.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ibishushanyo mwicuriye ngo mubisenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ni co gituma nzobirukana mukaja kure hirya y’i Babiloni.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amosi 5:25-27</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Ba sogokuruza bacu bari bafise ihema ry’isezerano bagendana mu bugaragwa. Ryari ryubatswe nk’uko Imana yari yategetse Mose, hakurikijwe ishusho yari yeretswe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Bamaze guhabwa iryo hema, ba sogokuruza, barongowe na Yosuwa, baje barizanye igihe bafata iki gihugu, Imana imaze kucirukanamwo amahanga yakibamwo imbere yabo. Iryo hema ryagumye mu gihugu gushika mu gihe c’umwami Dawidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawidi na we agirirwa ubuntu bwinshi n’Imana, bituma asaba kwubakira ihema Imana ya Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ariko Salomo ni we yahavuye ayubakira inzu.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Yamara, Iyisumbavyose ntiba mu nzu zubatswe n’amaboko y’abantu, nk’uko uwavugishwa n’Imana yavuze ati:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Ijuru ni intebe yanje y’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">isi na yo ni indava y’ibirenge vyanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Canke mwonyubakira inzu nyabaki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Ni ko Uhoraho abaza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Canke ikibanza canje co kuruhukiramwo coba hehe?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Mbega ukuboko kwanje si kwo kwaremye ivyo vyose?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Yesaya 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Mwa ntagondwa mwe! Imitima yanyu n’amatwi yanyu ntibirakebwa. Mumeze nka ba sogokuruza banyu: mwama mugarariza Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Mbega hari umuvugishwa n’umwe ba sogokuruza banyu batahamye? Mbere bishe n’abavugishijwe ku kuza kwa wa Mugororotsi. None namwe ubu mwaramugurishije, muramwica, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />kandi ari mwebwe mwakiriye ivyagezwe mubihawe n’abamarayika, ariko ntimwavyumvira.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Setefano yicishwa amabuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Abagize inama nkuru y’Abayuda bumvise ivyo, ishavu rirabarengera bashinga amenyo ku yandi kubera uburake. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ariko Setefano yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, arangamiza mw’ijuru, abona ubwiza bw’Imana, abona na Yesu ahagaze i buryo bw’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Aca avuga ati: “Ehe mbonye ijuru ryugurutse, mbona n’Umwana w’Umuntu ahagaze i buryo bw’Imana.”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ariko avuga uko, baca bazibira amatwi yabo kugira ntibamwumve, bashira urwamo hejuru, baca bamuhundarako icarimwe, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />bamukwegera inyuma y’igisagara, batangura kumutera amabuye. Mu kumutera amabuye, abariko baramurega babanje kwikura imitamana yabo, biyirambika imbere y’ibirenge vy’umusore yitwa Sawuli.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Bakiriko baramutera amabuye, Setefano arasenga ati: “Mwami Yesu, akira ubugingo bwanje.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Aca agwa apfukamye, asemerera ati: “Mwami, ntubaharureko iki caha.” Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca aracikana.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Na Sawuli ni ho yari ari kandi yari ashigikiye ko Setefano yicwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Ihamwa ry’Ishengero no gusanzara kwaryo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Uwo musi haca haduka ihamwa rikomeye kw’ishengero ry’i Yerusalemu, maze abigishwa bose, kiretse intumwa, barashwiragira, bamwe baja i Yudaya abandi baja n’i Samariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Abantu bubaha Imana baraza bahamba Setefano, kandi baramugandarira cane. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ariko Sawuli we abandanya gusambura ishengero. Yinjira mu nzu ku yindi, afata abagabo n’abagore bizera asanzeyo, abata mw’ibohero.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo avuga ubutumwa i Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Abo bashwiragiye bagenda barigisha ijambo ry’Imana aho baba bageze hose. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Nuko Filipo amanuka mu gisagara kimwe c’i Samariya, abwira abantu baho ivya Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Maze abantu benshi bamaze kwumva amajambo ya Filipo, bakabona n’ibitangaza akora, baca bashira umutima ku nyigisho ziwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Kuko abantu benshi baboshwe n’impwemu mbi barabohoka, izo mpwemu zikabavamwo zikoma induru, abanyunyutse n’abacumbagira bagakira. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ivyo bituma haba umunezero mwinshi muri ico gisagara.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivya Simoni umunyamareba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Hari umugabo yitwa Simoni yari amaze igihe ari umunyamareba muri ico gisagara, agatangaza ab’i Samariya bose, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />kandi abantu bose, abahambaye n’aboroshe, baramutangarira bakavuga bati: “Uwu mugabo ni bwa bushobozi bw’Imana, bita ‘Ubushobozi Buhambaye.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Barakunda kumwumviriza kuko yari amaze igihe abatangaza n’amareba yiwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ariko bamaze kwizera Ubutumwa Bwiza babwiwe na Filipo ku vyerekeye Ubwami bw’Imana n’izina rya Yesu Kristo, abagabo n’abagore benshi barabatizwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Na Simoni na we arabatizwa, aca aguma akurikira Filipo aho yaja hose, atangarira ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza Filipo akora.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Intumwa zari i Yerusalemu zumvise ko i Samariya abantu bakiriye Ijambo ry’Imana, baca barungika Petero na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bashitseyo, barabasengera kugira ngo baronke Mpwemu Yera, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kuko nta muntu n’umwe muri bo yari bwaronke Mpwemu Yera; bari babatijwe mw’izina ry’Umwami Yesu gusa. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Maze Petero na Yohana babarambikako ibiganza, baronka Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni abonye ko abantu baronka Mpwemu Yera barambitsweko ibiganza n’intumwa, aca abazanira amahera, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ababwira ati: “Nimumpe nanje ubwo bubasha kugira ngo uwo nzorambikako ibiganza azoronke Mpwemu Yera.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Petero aramwishura ati: “Amahera yawe aragapfana na we, kuko wibaza ko woshobora kugura ingabire y’Imana amahera. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Nta n’agace canke umugabane ufise muri iki gikorwa, kuko umutima wawe utagororotse imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Nuko niwihane ivyo vyiyumviro bibi, usenge Umwami Imana. Kumbure yoguharira ivyo vyiyumviro bibi biri mu mutima wawe. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kuko ndabona ko wuzuye umururazi, kandi ko uri umugurano w’ikibi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni aca yishura ati: “Nsengera ku Mwami Imana kugira ngo ivyo uvuze vyose ntihagire na kimwe kizombako.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bamaze gushinga intahe no kuvuga Ijambo ry’Umwami Imana, Petero na Yohana baca basubira i Yerusalemu, bagenda baravuga Ubutumwa Bwiza mu mihana myinshi y’i Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo abwira Ubutumwa Bwiza Umunyetiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Maze umumarayika w’Umwami Imana abarira Filipo ati: “Va hasi ufate inzira ija mu bumanuko, iva i Yerusalemu ija i Gaza ho mu bugaragwa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Nuko afata iyo nzira, akiriko aragenda ahura n’inkone y’Umunyetiyopiya, yari umutware akomeye, ajejwe ubutunzi bwa Kanidake, umwamikazi w’Abanyetiyopiya. Uwo muntu yari yagiye i Yerusalemu gusenga. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Ariko arataha, yicaye mu mukogote wiwe, yagenda arasoma igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mpwemu w’Imana abwira Filipo ati: “Egera uriya mukogote, uwugendere i ruhande.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Nuko Filipo aranyaruka, agendera i ruhande y’uwo mukogote, yumva wa muntu ariko asoma igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya. Aramubaza ati: “Mbega ivyo uriko urasoma urabitahura?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Na we aramwishura ati: “Nobitahura gute ata wubinsiguriye?” Aca asaba Filipo ngo yurire mu mukogote, baca baricarana.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Iyo nkone yariko isoma Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Yatwawe nk’intama ijanwa kubagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">atekereza nk’intama imbere y’uwuyimwa ubwoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ntiyigeze akurako umunwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Yarateterejwe abura uwumurenganura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Ni nde yovuga ivy’uruvyaro rwiwe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Erega ubuzima bwiwe bwakuwe kw’isi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Yesaya 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Maze iyo nkone ibaza Filipo iti: “Mbwira: uwu muntu uwavugishwa n’Imana avuga ko ni nde, ni we yivugako canke avuga ku wundi muntu?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipo aca ahera kuri ivyo vyanditswe nyene, amubwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bakiri mu nzira bagenda, bashika ahantu hari amazi, ya nkone iravuga iti: “Ko hano hari amazi, ni igiki combuza kubatizwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:36">[ <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo aramwishura ati: “Niwaba wizeye n’umutima wawe wose, urashobora kubatizwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">Na we arishura ati: “Ndizeye ko Yesu Kristo ari Umwana w’Imana.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Nuko aca ategeka ko bahagarika umukogote, barururuka baja mu mazi, Filipo aca aramubatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bavuye mu mazi, Mpwemu w’Imana aca ajana Filipo, ya nkone ntiyasubira kumubona, ariko aca abandanya urugendo anezerewe cane. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo na we aca asubira kubonekera muri Azoto, ahaca agenda avuga Ubutumwa Bwiza mu bisagara vyose gushika ashitse i Kayisariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwihana kwa Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ico gihe Sawuli yari ageramiye abigishwa b’Umwami Yesu, ahiga kubica. Nuko aja ku muherezi mukuru, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />amusaba amakete atwara mu masinagogi y’i Damasiko, kugira ngo nihagira abo asanga bakurikira inzira y’Umwami Yesu, baba abagabo canke abagore, ace abatwara nk’imbohe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Akigenda, yegereje i Damasiko, umuco uvuye mw’ijuru umurasirako giturumbuka impande zose. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Aca agwa hasi, yumva ijwi rimubwira riti: <char style="wj">“Sawuli, Sawuli, uriko umpamira iki?”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Na we arabaza ati: “Uri nde ga Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Iryo jwi na ryo riti: <char style="wj">“Ndi Yesu, uwo uriko urahama.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" /><char style="wj">Ariko haguruka ushike mu gisagara, ni ho uzobwirirwa ivyo ukwiye gukora.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Abari kumwe na Sawuli bahagarara bumiwe, kuko bumva ijwi ariko batabona uwuvuga. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sawuli ava hasi, ariko agerageje gukanura, ntiyashobora kubona. Baca bamufata ukuboko bamutwara i Damasiko, <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />ahamara imisi itatu atabona, ata co arya kandi ata co anywa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />I Damasiko hariho umwigishwa wa Yesu yitwa Ananiya. Maze Umwami Yesu aramwiyereka mu nzozi, aramuhamagara ati: <char style="wj">“Ananiya!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Na we arishura ati: “Sabwe Mwami!”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Umwami Yesu aramubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Haguruka uje kw’ibarabara ryitwa irigororotse, ushitse i muhira kwa Yuda, ubaze bakwereke umugabo yitwa Sawuli ava i Taruso, kuko ni ho ari ariko arasenga.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" /><char style="wj">Kandi mu nzozi, yabonye umuntu yitwa Ananiya aza kumurambikako ibiganza kugira ngo ahumuke.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiya aca aramwishura ati: “Mwami, narumvise benshi bavuga ivy’uwo muntu n’amabi yakoreye abera bawe i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Kandi yaje hano afise ububasha yahawe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru kugira ngo afate abo bose bambaza izina ryawe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ariko Umwami Yesu yishura Ananiya ati: <char style="wj">“Genda, kuko uwo Sawuli ari igikoresho natoranije kugira ngo amenyekanishe izina ryanje mu Banyamahanga n’abami babo, ndetse n’abo mu Bisirayeli.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" /><char style="wj">Kandi jewe ubwanje nzomwereka imibabaro yose akwiye kuzobabazwa ku bw’izina ryanje.”</char><verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Nuko Ananiya aca aragenda arinjira muri iyo nzu. Maze aca arambika ibiganza kuri Sawuli, avuga ati: “Mwene Data Sawuli, Umwami Yesu, uwakwiyeretse uri mu nzira uza, yakuntumyeko kugira ngo uhumuke kandi wuzure Mpwemu Yera.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ubwo nyene, ibintu bimeze nk’ibikaragashi biva ku maso ya Sawuli, arahumuka. Ubwo nyene aca ava hasi arabatizwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Nuko ahejeje gufungura, inguvu zongera kugaruka.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawuli yigisha i Damasiko n’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Nuko Sawuli amarana imisi n’abigishwa i Damasiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Maze atangura kwigisha mu masinagogi ko Yesu ari Umwana w’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Abamwumva bose baratangara, bakabazanya bati: “Mbega uwu mugabo si umwe yahora atikiza abasenga izina rya Yesu i Yerusalemu? Mbega ntiyari yazanywe ino no gufata abizera kugira ngo abatware nk’imbohe ku baherezi bakurubakuru?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ariko inyigisho za Sawuli zirushiriza kugira ubushobozi mu kwemeza Abayuda b’i Damasiko ko Yesu ari we Kristo kuko zatuma bataronka n’ico basubizayo.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Haciye igihe, Abayuda barondera ingena bomwica, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />ariko Sawuli amenya imigambi yabo mibi. Ijoro n’umurango bama bamutegereye ku marembo y’igisagara kugira ngo bamwice. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ijoro rimwe, bamwe mu Bigishwa bamushira mu giseke, bamucisha mw’idirisha ry’uruzitiro rw’igisagara, bamwururukiriza inyuma.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ashitse i Yerusalemu, agomba kwifatanya n’abandi bigishwa, ariko bose baramutinya, kuko batizera ko yahindutse umwigishwa vy’ukuri. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ariko Baranaba aramufata amujana ku ntumwa, abasigurira ingene Sawuli yahuye n’Umwami Yesu ari mu nzira aja i Damasiko akavugana na we, n’ingene i Damasiko yigishije mw’izina rya Yesu ata bwoba. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Maze Sawuli aca agumana n’intumwa i Yerusalemu yidegemvya, yigisha ashize amanga mw’izina rya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Yama avugana yongera aharira n’Abayuda bavuga Ikigiriki, ariko bo bakama barondera ingene bomwica. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Abizera Kristo babimenye, baca bamumanukana i Kayisariya, bamurungika i Taruso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ico gihe, Ishengero ry’i Yudaya, i Galilaya n’i Samariya rigira amahoro, rirakomera, kuko abizera bagendera mu kwubaha Umwami Imana. Kandi kubera ritewe intege na Mpwemu Yera riragwira mu gitigiri.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero akiza Ayineya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Nuko Petero agendagenda muri izo ntara zose, hanyuma amanuka kuramutsa abizera b’i Luda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Maze, ahasanga umugabo yitwa Ayineya, yari amaze imyaka umunani yose adashobora kuva ku buriri kuko yari yarakongataye. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Hanyuma Petero aca aramubwira ati: “Ayineya, Yesu Kristo aragukijije. Haguruka uzinge ikirago cawe.” Ubwo nyene Ayineya aca arahaguruka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Ababa i Luda n’i Sharoni bose bamubonye agendagenda, baca barihana bizera Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero azura Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kandi i Yopa hariho umwigishwa yitwa Tabita (mu Kigiriki risobanurwa ngo Dorukasi, ni ukuvuga Ingeregere), yama akora ibikorwa vyiza, agafasha abakene. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Muri iyo misi aragwara, hanyuma arapfa. Ikiziga ciwe baracoza, bakibika mu cumba co hejuru. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Kubera i Luda n’i Yopa hari hegeranye, abigishwa b’i Yopa bumvise ko Petero ari i Luda, bamutumako abagabo babiri bati: “Turakwinginze ushike iwacu udatevye.”<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Nuko Petero arahaguruka ajana na bo. Bashitse baca bamutwara muri ico cumba co hejuru. Abapfakazi bose baraza bakikuza Petero bariko bararira, bamwereka amakanzu n’izindi mpuzu Dorukasi yari yarabakoreye akiri kumwe na bo.<verse eid="ACT 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Maze Petero arabataramura bose, aca arapfukama arasenga. Hanyuma ahindukirira ikiziga, avuga ati: “Tabita, vyuka!” Nuko Tabita arakanura. Abonye Petero, aca aravyuka aricara. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petero aca amufata ukuboko aramuhagurutsa. Hanyuma ahamagara abizera, na canecane abapfakazi, amubashikiriza ari muzima. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Maze iyo nkuru ica yamamara i Yopa hose, kandi abantu benshi bizera Umwami Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petero aca amara imisi myinshi i Yopa kwa Simoni, yakora ivyo gutunganya insato.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakora ivy’insato bafatwa nk’abantu bahumanye kandi basuzuguritse kuko bakora ku bikoko vyapfuye.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Koruneliyo abwirwa gutumako Simoni Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />I Kayisariya hariho umugabo yitwa Koruneliyo, yari umugabisha w’umuce w’ingabo bita Umuce w’Abataliyano. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />We n’umuryango wiwe bari bariyeguriye kwubaha Imana. Yaratanga ivyiwe abifashisha aboro, kandi agasenga ubudasiba. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Umusi umwe, hari nk’igihe c’isaha cenda z’umuhingamo, yerekwa abona mu buryo bugarara umumarayika w’Imana yinjiye aho ari, maze avuga ati: “Koruneliyo!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Koruneliyo na we amuhanga amaso yuzuye ubwoba, aramubaza ati: “Ni iki ga Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Uwo mumarayika aramwishura ati: “Amasengesho yawe n’ibikorwa vyawe vyo gufasha abakene vyaduze imbere y’Imana biba ishikanwa ry’icibutso. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Nuko rero rungika abantu i Yopa, bazane umugabo yitwa Simoni ari we Petero. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ari kumwe na Simoni, akora ivyo gutunganya insato, inzu yiwe iri ku nkengera y’ikiyaga.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Wa mumarayika baganira amaze kugenda, Koruneliyo aca ahamagara babiri mu bakozi bari kumwe hamwe n’umusoda yubaha Imana, umwe mu bamugendanira. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Nuko ababwira ivyabaye vyose aca abatuma i Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo Petero yeretswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Bukeye, nk’igihe c’isaha zitandatu z’umurango, ba bantu bakiri mu nzira bagira bashike i Yopa, Petero aduga hejuru ku gisenge c’inzu gusenga. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Hanyuma arasonza, ashaka ico arya. Bakiriko barategura infungurwa, aca aja mu vyo kwerekwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Abona ijuru ryugurutse, abona ikintu kimeze nk’igitambara kinini cururutswa hasi gifashwe ku mitwe yaco uko ari ine. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Carimwo ibikoko vy’ubwoko bwose bigendera ku maguru ane, ibikwega inda hasi, hamwe n’ibiguruka mu kirere. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Maze yumva ijwi rimubwira riti: <char style="wj">“Petero we, haguruka, ubage, urye.”</char><verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petero na we yishura ati: “Oyaye Mwami, ntibikabe! Kuko jewe ntigeze ndya ikintu na kimwe gihumanye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Rya jwi ryongera kumubwira ubwa kabiri riti: <char style="wj">“Ico Imana yahumanuye ntukacite igihumanye.”</char><verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ivyo biba incuro zitatu, ca gitambara gica gisubira kuduzwa mw’ijuru.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petero akiriko ariyumvira insobanuro y’ivyo yeretswe, ba bantu bavuye kwa Koruneliyo baba barashitse kuri ya nzu ya Simoni, bahagarara kw’irembo. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Maze barahamagara babaza ko Simoni yitwa Petero yoba ari ho asavye indaro.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petero akiriko ariyumvira kuri bimwe yerekwa, Mpwemu Yera aramubwira ati: “Simoni, hari abantu batatu bariko barakurondera. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Haguruka wururuke kandi ntutinye kujana na bo kuko ari jewe nabarungitse.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petero arururuka, abwira ba bantu ati: “Ni jewe muriko murarondera. Muzanywe n’iki?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ba bantu barishura bati: “Turungitswe na Koruneliyo, umugabisha w’abasoda ijana. Ni umugororotsi yubaha Imana, ashingirwa intahe n’ubwoko bw’Abayuda bwose. Umumarayika yamubwiye ngo agutumeko iwe kugira ngo yumve ivyo uri bumubwire.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Nuko Petero aca arabakira ngo barare ngaho.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 10:23">Petero yigisha mu nzu kwa Koruneliyo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Bukeye Petero ajana na bo, aherekejwe na bamwe bo mu bizera b’i Yopa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ku musi ukurikira barashika i Kayisariya, kandi Koruneliyo mu kubarindira, yari yakoranije incuti n’abagenzi biwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petero ashitse mu nzu, Koruneliyo aca akubita ibipfukamiro hasi ngo amusenge. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ariko Petero aramubwira ati: “Haguruka kuko nanje ndi umuntu nka we!”<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Nuko bagenda baraganira berekeje aho abantu benshi bari bari. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Maze Petero aca ababwira ati: “Murazi neza ko amategeko y’idini ryacu atemerera Umuyuda kwifatanya n’umunyamahanga canke ngo amugendere. Ariko Imana yanyeretse ko ntakwiye gufata umuntu n’umwe nk’uwuhumanye. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ni co gituma igihe mwantumako nemeye kuza ntahigimanze. Nagomba rero kubaza icatumye muntumako.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koruneliyo aramwishura ati: “Haciye imisi itatu, nari iwanje ndiko ndasenga, hari nk’igihe c’isaha icenda. Hanyuma mbona umuntu yambaye impuzu zikayangana ahagaze imbere yanje <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ambarira ati: ‘Koruneliyo, Imana yumvise amasengesho yawe, kandi yibutse n’ibikorwa vyawe vyo gufasha aboro. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tumako Simoni bita Petero, ari i Yopa. Asavye indaro mu nzu kwa Simoni akora umwuga wo gutunganya insato, aba ku nkengera y’ikiyaga.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ni ko guca ndagutumako ubwo nyene, kandi wagize neza kuza. None rero ubu twese turi hano imbere y’Imana kugira ngo twumve ivyo Imana yagutumye kutubwira vyose.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Nuko rero Petero aherako avuga ati: “Ubu rero ni ho nkimenya vy’ukuri ko Imana idatoranya abantu ku butoni, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ariko ko mu mahanga yose umuntu wese ayubaha agakora ibigororotse imwemera. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Murazi ijambo Imana yarungikiye Abisirayeli, ryavuga inkuru nziza y’amahoro abonerwa muri Yesu Kristo, ari we Mwami wa bose. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Murazi ivyabaye i Yudaya hose, uhereye i Galilaya inyuma y’umubatizo Yohana yigisha; <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />ingene Imana yarobanuje Yesu w’i Nazareti Mpwemu Yera n’ubushobozi, n’ukuntu yagendagenda hose agira neza, akiza abari mu gacinyizo ka wa mubi, kuko Imana yari kumwe na we.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Natwe turi ivyabona vyo gushingira intahe ivyo yakoze vyose mu gihugu c’Abayuda n’i Yerusalemu. Yishwe abambwe ku musaraba, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />ariko Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye ku musi ugira gatatu, ituma asubira kuboneka. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Ntiyabonywe na bose, kiretse twebwe abo Imana yari yaratoranije nk’ivyabona, twasangiye na we ivyokurya n’ibinyobwa amaze kuzuka mu bapfuye. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kandi yadutumye kwigisha abantu no gushinga intahe ko ari we Imana yashizeho ngo abe umucamanza w’abazima n’abapfuye. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Abavugishwa n’Imana bose baramushingira intahe ko uwumwizeye wese azoharirwa ivyaha mw’izina ryiwe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petero akiriko aravuga ayo majambo, Mpwemu Yera amanukira ku bumvise ubwo butumwa bose. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Abizera bo mu bakebwe bari bazananye na Petero batangazwa cane n’uko ingabire ya Mpwemu Yera yasutswe no ku Banyamahanga na bo, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />kuko babumvise bavuga mu ndimi zitamenyekana, bahimbaza Imana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Maze Petero aca avuga ati: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Mbega hari uwobuza aba bantu kubatizwa mu mazi, kandi baronse Mpwemu Yera nk’uko natwe twamuronse?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nuko asaba ko bababatiza mw’Izina rya Yesu Kristo. Baca binginga Petero ngo amarane na bo imisi na mikeya.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petero yisigura ku vyabereye kwa Koruneliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Intumwa n’abandi bizera b’i Yudaya bumva ko Abanyamahanga na bo bakiriye ijambo ry’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Maze Petero asubiye i Yerusalemu, abizera bakebwe ari bo Bayuda baramunegura, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />bati: “Wewe warinjiye mu nzu y’abatakebwe, mbere warasangiye na bo!”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Nuko Petero ahera ku ntango, abasigurira neza vyose uko vyagenze. Arababwira ati: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Nari i Yopa ndiko ndasenga, hanyuma mera nk’uwutwawe n’agatiro, nca ntangura kwerekwa. Mbona ikintu kimeze nk’igitambara kinini cururuka kiva mw’ijuru gifashwe ku mitwe yaco uko ari ine, gishika aho nari ndi. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nihweje muri co, mbona ibikoko bigendera ku maguru ane, inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba, ibikwega inda hasi hamwe n’ibiguruka mu kirere. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Nca numva ijwi rimbarira riti: <char style="wj">‘Petero we, haguruka, ubage urye.’</char><verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nanje ndishura nti: ‘Oyaye Mwami, ntibikabe! Kuko jewe ntigeze ndya ikintu na kimwe gihumanye.’<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Rya jwi ryongera kuvuga ubwa kabiri rivuye mw’ijuru riti: <char style="wj">‘Ico Imana yahumanuye ntukacite igihumanye.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ivyo biba incuro zitatu, ca gitambara gica gisubira kuduzwa mw’ijuru.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ubwo nyene abantu batatu bantumweko bavuye i Kayisariya baba barashitse imbere y’inzu nari natsemwo indaro. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mpwemu Yera ambarira ko nojana na bo ntakekeranije. Aba bene Data batandatu baramperekeje i Kayisariya, maze twese twinjira kwa Koruneliyo, <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />na we aca atubwira ko yabonye umumarayika ahagaze mu nzu iwe amubwira ati: ‘Rungika abantu i Yopa bazane umuntu yitwa Simoni ari we Petero. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Azokuzanira ubutumwa buzogukizanya n’abo mu nzu yawe bose.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ntanguye kuvuga, Mpwemu Yera abazako nk’uko yatujeko mu ntango. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Nca nibuka ivyo Umwami Yesu yavuze, ati: <char style="wj">‘Yohana yabatiza mu mazi, ariko mwebwe muzobatizwa muri Mpwemu Yera.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />None rero nimba Imana yabahaye ingabire nk’iyo yaduhaye, twebwe twizeye Umwami Yesu Kristo, mbega jewe nari iki ngo mbe intambamyi ku gikorwa c’Imana?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Bavyumvise ntibagira ico basubizayo, ahubwo bashima Imana, bavuga bati: “Erega noneho Imana ihaye Abanyamahanga na bo akaryo ko kwihana ivyaha vyabo ngo baronke ubugingo budashira.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishengero rivuka muri Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Nuko abari barasabagiye kubera ihamwa ryari ryatanguranye n’urupfu rwa Setefano baragenda gushika i Foyinike, i Kupuro no muri Antiyokiya, babwira ijambo ry’Imana Abayuda bonyene. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ariko bamwe muri bo, abava i Kupuro n’i Kurene, baja muri Antiyokiya, batangura kwigisha n’Abagiriki na bo, bababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Umwami Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ikiganza c’Umwami Imana cari kuri bo, bituma abantu benshi bizera, bahindukirira Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Inkuru zabo zishikira ishengero ry’i Yerusalemu, maze barungika Baranaba muri Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ashitseyo akibonera ico ubuntu bw’Imana bwakoze, aranezerwa cane, yongera arabinginga bose ngo bashishikare gukurikira Umwami n’imitima yabo yose. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Baranaba yari umuntu w’umugwaneza, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera n’ukwizera. Nuko igitigiri kinini c’abantu bizera Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Inyuma y’aho Baranaba aca aja i Taruso kurondera Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Amubonye, aca amujana muri Antiyokiya, bompi bamarana umwaka n’ishengero, bigisha abantu benshi cane. Aho muri Antiyokiya ni ho abigishwa batanguriye kwitwa Abakristo.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Muri ico gihe, abavugishwa n’Imana bamwe bamanutse bava i Yerusalemu, baja muri Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Umwe muri bo yitwa Agabo, arahaguruka, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, avuga ko ikigoyi kizotera mu bwami bw’Abaroma bwose. (Ivyo vyahavuye bishika ku ngoma ya Korode.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Nuko abigishwa bo muri Antiyokiya, bivanye n’ico umwumwe wese ashoboye, bafata ingingo yo kurungikira imfashanyo abizera b’i Yudaya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Nuko barabishitsa, barungikira imfashanyo zabo abakuru b’ishengero ry’i Yerusalemu, zijanwa na Baranaba na Sawuli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Petero ashirwa mw’ibohero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Muri ico gihe, ni ho umwami Herode Agiripa yatangura gufata bamwe mu bo mw’isheshengero, atangura kubahama. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Nuko afata Yakobo, yavukana na Yohana, amwicisha inkota. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Abonye binejereje Abayuda, afata na Petero. Ivyo vyabaye mu gihe c’imisi mikuru y’imikate itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Amaze kumufata, amushira mw’ibohero amuha imigwi ine y’abasoda bane bane bakuranwa kumurinda. Herode yagomba kuzomucira urubanza ku mugaragaro inyuma ya Pasika.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Nuko Petero ashirwa mw’ibohero, ariko ishengero riguma risenga Imana n’umwete mwinshi ku bwiwe.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Buca Herode amucira urubanza, Petero yari asinziriye, aryamye hagati y’abasoda babiri, abohesheje iminyororo ibiri. Abandi basoda bari baraririye ku muryango w’ibohero. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Umumarayika w’Umwami Imana aca araza, umuco urasira mu cumba Petero yarimwo, amukoma mu rubavu, aramukangura, amubwira ati: “Vyuka ningoga!” Ubwo nyene ya minyororo ica imuva ku bikonjo, irakoroka.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Uwo mumarayika aca abarira Petero ati: “Ambara impuzu n’ibirato vyawe.” Nuko Petero aravyambara. Wa mumarayika arasubira ati: “Ambara umutamana wawe, unkurikire.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Maze Petero aca aramukurikira barasohoka, ariko ntiyari azi ko ivyo uwo mumarayika ariko arakora vyari ivy’ukuri. Yiyumvira ko yariko arerekwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Nuko baca ku bararirizi ba mbere n’aba kabiri, bashika no ku rugi rw’irembo ryaja mu gisagara, rwari urw’icuma. Maze ruriyugurura, bararengana, barasohoka. Bagishika mw’ibarabara, wa mumarayika asiga ngaho Petero, ntiyasubira kumubona.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ni ho Petero yatora akenge, avuga ati: “Ubu rero ndamenye vy’ukuri ko Umwami Imana yarungitse umumarayika kundokora mu vyara vya Herode n’ivyo Abayuda bari bateguye kungirira vyose.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Amaze gutahura ivyo, aca aja i muhira kwa Mariya nyina wa Yohana ari we Mariko, aho abizera benshi bari bakoraniye bariko barasenga. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petero aradodora ku rugi rwo kw’irembo, umukobwa w’umuguranokazi yitwa Roda aca aza kuraba uwudodoye. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Yumvise ijwi rya Petero, aranezerwa cane, aca asubira inyuma yiruka atuguruye, avuga ati: “Ni Petero ari kw’irembo!”<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Baca bamubwira bati: “Na mba wataye ubwenge!” Ariko babonye ashishikaye kuvyemeza, baca bavuga bati: “Ashobora kuba ari umumarayika wiwe!”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Petero ashishikara kudodora, buguruye urugi basanga ni we, baratangara cane. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petero aca arabamama ngo batekereze, aca abiganira ido n’ido ukuntu Umwami Imana yamukuye mw’ibohero. Arababwira ati: “Murabibwira Yakobo n’abandi bene Data.” Aca ava aho aragenda.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bukeye, haba uruhagarara hagati y’abasoda, bibaza ivyashikiye Petero. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herode Agiripa amaze kumurondeza hose bakamubura, aca agira itohoza mu basoda, aca ategeka ko babica.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 12:19">Urupfu rwa Herode Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Maze Herode aca ava i Yudaya yigira i Kayisariya, amarayo igihe. <verse eid="ACT 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Yari amaze igihe atumvikana n’abantu b’i Tiro n’i Sidoni, maze na bo baja hamwe bamusaba umubonano. Bafashijwe na Bulasito, umukuru w’abategura icumba c’umwami, basaba kugiranira amasezerano y’amahoro, kuko ivyo bihugu vyasumira mu bwami Herode Agiripa yatwara.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Isango rigeze, Herode yambara ikanzu y’inyambarabami, yicara ku ntebe y’ubwami, abwira ijambo abari ngaho. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Maze abantu basemererera rimwe bavuga bati: “Iyi ni imana ivuze, si umuntu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ariko, kubera Herode Agiripa atahesheje Imana icubahiro, akemera ko abantu bamuninahaza, ubwo nyene umumarayika aca aramukubita, aribwa n’inyo, aca arapfa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Nuko ijambo ry’Imana rica rirashishikara kugwira no kwamamara.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Baranaba na Sawuli baheraheza igikorwa cabo, baca bava i Yerusalemu, bagenda bajanye na Yohana, ari we Mariko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mw’ishengero ryo muri Antiyokiya hari abavugishwa n’Imana n’abigisha ari bo Baranaba, Simeyoni bita Mwirabure, Lukiyo Umunyakurene, Manayeni yari yakuranye na Herode Antipa, hamwe na Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Bariko barasenga Imana bisonzesheje, Mpwemu Yera ababarira ati: “Ntoraniriza Baranaba na Sawuli, bankorere igikorwa nabahamagariye.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Bahejeje kwisonzesha no gusenga, baca babarambikako ibiganza, barabarungika.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli avuga ubutumwa i Kupuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Nuko baragenda batumwe na Mpwemu Yera, bamanuka i Seluwukiya, baca bafata ubwato buja mw’izinga ryitwa Kupuro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bageze i Salamini bavuga ijambo ry’Imana mu masinagogi y’Abayuda, kandi Yohana Mariko yagendana na bo abakorera.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Nuko bagendagenda iryo zinga ryose gushika bashitse i Pafo. Aho bahahuriye n’Umuyuda w’umunyamareba yigira umuvugishwa, yitwa Bari Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />yagendanira Serejiyo Pawulo, yaserukira Kayisari aho hantu; uwo yari umuntu w’umunyabwenge. Nuko Serejiyo Pawulo atumako Baranaba na Sawuli, kugira ngo yumve ijambo ry’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ariko wa munyamareba Eluma (izina ryiwe ni ko risobanurwa mu Kigiriki), arabahaririza agomba guhuvya ukwizera kw’uwo aserukira Kayisari. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Maze Sawuli, ari we yitwa Pawulo, yuzuye Mpwemu Yera, amuhanga amaso, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />amubwira ati: “Wa mwana wa wa mubi we, umwansi w’ivyiza vyose! Uzogeza ryari kubuza abantu kugororokera Umwami? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Noneho rero Imana ibanguye ukuboko ngo iguhane. Ugiye guhuma, kandi kuva ubu ntuzosubira kubona umuco w’izuba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Ubwo nyene amaso yiwe aca yuzura umwijima, amera nk’uwo bwiriyeko, atangura kujuragirika mu mpande zose arondera uwomufata ukuboko. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Maze uwo aserukira Kayisari abonye ibibaye arizera kuko yari atangajwe cane n’izo nyigisho zavuga ivy’Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo na Baranaba bashika muri Antiyokiya h’i Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Bavuye i Pafo, Pawulo n’abo bari kumwe baca bafata ubwato baja i Pamfiliya ahitwa Peruga, Yohana Mariko aca abasigaho asubira i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Hanyuma bava i Peruga baja muri Antiyokiya h’i Pisidiya. Ku musi w’Isabato baja mw’isinagogi baricara. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bahejeje gusoma mu gitabu c’Ivyagezwe n’abavugishwa n’Imana, abakuru b’isinagogi baca batuma umuntu ababaza ati: “Bene Data, nimwaba mufise ijambo ryo gutera intege abantu, nimuhaguruke mwigishe.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pawulo ahagurutse, arabamama ngo bacereze, maze ababwira ati: “Yemwe Bisirayeli namwe Banyamahanga mwubaha Imana, muntege amatwi! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Imana y’ubwoko bwa Isirayeli ni yo yatoranije ba sogokuruza, ibaha kuba ihanga rikomeye mu gihugu c’Abanyamahanga Egiputa, hanyuma ibakuzayo ukuboko kwayo kw’ubushobozi, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />yihanganira ubugaba bwabo imyaka mirongo ine mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Yaranduye amahanga indwi yo mu gihugu c’i Kanani, igiha ubwoko bwacu ngo bucegukire. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ivyo vyose vyabaye nko mu kiringo c’imyaka amajana ane na mirongo itanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Inyuma y’ivyo Imana yabahaye abacamanza gushika mu gihe c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ariko mu nyuma bayisaba umwami, na yo ibaha Sawuli mwene Kishi, yava mu muryango wa Benyamini, abaganza imyaka mirongo ine. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Imaze gukura Sawuli, yimitse Dawidi ngo abe umwami wabo. Yamushingiye intahe iti: ‘Nironkeye Dawidi mwene Isayi, umuntu ahuye n’uko umutima wanje ugomba, azoshitsa ivyo ngomba vyose.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Mu ruvyaro rw’uwo muntu, ni ho Imana yacishije Yesu, umukiza w’Abisirayeli, nk’uko yari yarabisezeranye. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Imbere y’ukuza kwa Yesu, Yohana yigisha ukwihana n’ukubatizwa ku bantu bose b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohana ariko araheraheza igikorwa ciwe, yavuze ati: ‘Mwibaza ko ndi nde? Sindi wa wundi mwiteze, haba na mba. Ariko hari uwuje inyuma yanje; ntibimbereye no gupfundurura utugozi tw’ibirato vyiwe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Bene Data, buzukuruza ba Aburahamu, namwe Banyamahanga mwubaha Imana, ni twebwe ubu butumwa bw’agakiza bwarungikiwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ababa i Yerusalemu n’abatware babo ntibamenye Yesu, ariko baramutsindishije, baba bashikije amajambo y’abavugishwa n’Imana yama asomwa ku musi w’Isabato. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Naho ata camwagira cari gutuma bamucira urubanza rwo gupfa, basavye Pilato kumwicisha. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Bamaze gushitsa ivyanditswe kuri we vyose, bamumanuye ku musaraba bamushira mu mva. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ariko Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />hanyuma amara imisi myinshi yiyereka abagendanye na we kuva i Galilaya gushika i Yerusalemu. Ubu ni bo bariko baramushingira intahe mu bwoko bwacu.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Natwe rero turi ngaha tubabwira iyi nkuru nziza: Ico Imana yasezeraniye ba sogokuruza <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />yagishikije ku bwacu, twebwe abana babo, mu kuzura Yesu mu bapfuye. Ibi ni vyo vyanditswe muri Zaburi ya kabiri ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Uri umwana wanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">uwu musi ndakuvyaye.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Zaburi 2:7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Imana yaramuzuye mu bapfuye kugira ngo ntaze yigere abora. Imana yabivuze muri aya majambo, iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Nzobaha imigisha itunganye kandi idahinduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">iyo nasezeraniye Dawidi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Yesaya 55:3</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ahandi naho havuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ntuzoreka uwera wawe ngo abore.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Zaburi 16:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Dawidi amaze gukora ivyo Imana igomba mu gihe ciwe, yarasinziriye, ahambwa hamwe na ba sekuruza, umubiri wiwe urabora. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ariko uwo Imana yazuye mu bapfuye ntiyigeze abora.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />None rero bene Data, turabamenyesha ko ari muri Yesu mumenyesherezwa inkuru yo guharirwa ivyaha. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Muri we, uwizera wese aba abohowe icaha ciwe cose, ari kwo kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi, ukwo mutashobora guhabwa n’Ivyagezwe vya Mose. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mwiyubare rero kugira ngo ivyo abavugishwa bavuze ntibibashikeko, aho bavuga ngo:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nimwitegereze, mwa bacokoranyi mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">mutangare maze muzimangane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Kuko mu gihe canyu ngiye gukora kintu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">mutokwigera mwemera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">naho hogira uwukibabwira.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Habakuki 1:5</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Mu gihe Pawulo na Baranaba bariko barasohoka bava mw’isinagogi, abantu barabinginga ngo bazogaruke ku musi w’Isabato ikurikira kugira ngo bashishikare kwigisha kuri ayo majambo. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Abantu bamaze gutaha, benshi bo mw’isinagogi y’Abayuda hamwe n’abandi bizeye Imana bakurikira Pawulo na Baranaba, na bo bagenda barabahimiriza ngo bagume mu buntu bw’Imana.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ku musi w’Isabato ukurikira, igisagara nka cose cari cakoranye ngo bumvirize ijambo ry’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Abayuda babonye ayo masinzi bagira ishari, batangura kuvuga ibinyuranye n’ivyo Pawulo yariko aravuga, banamutuka.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Pawulo na Baranaba baca barabishura ata bwoba bati: “Ni mwebwe mwari mukwiye kwumva ijambo ry’Imana ubwa mbere. Ariko ko muryanse, mukabona ko mutabereye ubugingo budashira, duhindukiriye Abanyamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kuko Umwami yari yadutegetse ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Nagushiriyeho kuba umuco ku Banyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">kugira ngo uzoshikane agakiza ku mpera z’isi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Yesaya 49:6</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Abanyamahanga bavyumvise baranezerwa cane, bahimbaza Ijambo ry’Umwami Imana; abari baratoranirijwe ubugingo budashira, barizera.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Nuko ijambo ry’Imana ryamamara muri iyo ntara yose. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ariko Abayuda bosha abagore b’icubahiro bubaha Imana, hamwe n’abagabo baganza igisagara, batangura guhama Pawulo na Baranaba, babirukana muri iyo ntara. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Pawulo na Baranaba na bo bakunkumura umukungugu wo mu birenge vyabo, baca baja muri Ikoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Kandi abigishwa bo muri Antiyokiya bari bafise umunezero mwinshi, buzuye Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zirukanwa muri Ikoniyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Muri Ikoniyo, Pawulo na Baranaba binjira mw’isinagogi nk’uko bahora babigenza. Maze bavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bwuzuye bashize amanga, bituma Abayuda n’Abanyamahanga benshi bizera. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ariko Abayuda banse kwizera bagumura abandi Banyamahanga babatera kwanka abizera. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Maze Pawulo na Baranaba bahamara igihe kitari gito, bavugira Umwami Yesu bashize amanga, na we agashingira intahe Ubutumwa bw’Ubuntu bavuga, mu kubakoresha ibitangaza n’utwumiza. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ivyo vyatumye abantu bo muri ico gisagara bicamwo imigwi, bamwe begamira Abayuda, abandi begamira intumwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Mu nyuma, Abayuda n’Abanyamahanga bamwe, bari kumwe n’abatware babo, baja inama yo kugirira nabi intumwa no kuzicisha amabuye. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Intumwa zibimenye, zica zihungira mu bisagara vya Lusitira na Derube biri i Lukawoniya, no mu micungararo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />N’aho nyene babandanije bahavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo akiza ikimuga i Lusitira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />I Lusitira hari umugabo yama yicaye kuko yari amugaye ibirenge. Yari yavutse amugaye, ntiyari yarigeze atambuka. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Nuko yumviriza Pawulo ariko arigisha, Pawulo na we aramwihweza, abona afise ukwizera kwotuma akira. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Pawulo aca avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Haguruka, uhagarare ku birenge vyawe!” Ubwo nyene wa mugabo aca arabaduka, aca atangura gutambuka.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ishengero ribonye ivyo Pawulo akoze, bavuga n’amajwi arenga mu Kinyalukawoniya bati: “imana zadushwayemwo zambaye imibiri y’abantu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Baranaba bamwita Zeyusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zeyusi yari imana nkuru y’Abagiriki.</char></note>, Pawulo na we bamwita Heremesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heremesi yari intumwa y’imana.</char></note>, kuko ari we yigisha kenshi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Maze umuherezi wa Zeyusi azana impfizi z’inka n’ingori z’amashurwe kw’irembo ry’igisagara; aho ni ho hari ingoro y’iyo mana. We n’iryo sinzi ry’abantu bagomba gushikanira ibimazi izo ntumwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ariko Pawulo na Baranaba bavyumvise, bitabagurirako impuzu, biruka mu bantu basemerera bati: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Mbega bagenzi, ivyo bintu mubikora kubera iki? Erega turi abantu nka mwebwe! Twabazaniye Ubutumwa Bwiza, bubabwira guhindukira mukava mu bitagira ikimazi, mukaza ku Mana nzima, yaremye ijuru, isi n’ikiyaga, n’ibibibamwo vyose. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Mu bihe vyaheze, yaretse amahanga yose ngo yigenze uko yipfuza. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ariko ntiyigeze ihengeshanya kubiyereka mu vyiza yabakorera: ikabaha imvura iva mw’ijuru n’umwimbu mwinshi mu gihe cavyo, ikabaha ivyokurya bikwiye, ikuzuza imitima yanyu umunezero.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Naho Pawulo yari avuze amajambo nk’ayo, intumwa vyarazigoye kubabuza kuzishikanira ibimazi.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Maze haca haza Abayuda bari bavuye i Antiyokiya no muri Ikoniyo, bosha abari aho bose, batera amabuye Pawulo, bamukwegera inyuma y’igisagara bibwira ko yapfuye. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ariko abandi bigishwa bamaze kuza bakegeranira aho yari ari, aca arahaguruka, asubira mu gisagara. Bukeye we na Baranaba baca barahava, baja i Derube.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basubira muri Antiyokiya ho muri Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Nuko bavuga Ubutumwa Bwiza muri ico gisagara kandi baharonka igitigiri kinini c’abigishwa. Hanyuma baca basubira i Lusitira, muri Ikoniyo no muri Antiyokiya <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />binginga abigishwa ngo bagume bahagaze mu kwizera. Bababwira bati: “Dutegerezwa guca mu bitubabaza vyinshi kugira twinjire mu Bwami bw’Imana.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pawulo na Baranaba, bamaze gusenga no kwisonzesha, baca bagena abakuru b’amashengero yose, babaragiza Umwami Yesu bari bizeye. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Nuko baca baca muri Pisidiya bashika i Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Bavuga ijambo ry’Imana i Peruga, baca bamanuka muri Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Bavuye muri Ataliya, baciye bafata ubwato basubira muri Antiyokiya ho muri Siriya, aho bari basengewe ng’Ubuntu bw’Imana buzobane na bo ku bw’ico gikorwa bari barangije. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bashitse muri Antiyokiya, bakoranya ishengero baryiganira ivyo Imana yabakoresheje vyose, n’ukuntu yugururiye imiryango Abanyamahanga na bo bakizera. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Maze baguma aho, babana n’abigishwa igihe kitari gito.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Inama ihambaye y’intumwa yabereye i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Abantu bamwe bavuye i Yudaya baja muri Antiyokiya, bigisha abizera bati: “Mudakebwe nk’uko imigenzo twigishijwe na Mose ibidutegeka, ntimushobora gukizwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Maze Pawulo na Baranaba binjira mu mpari zikomeye n’abo bantu. Nuko ishengero rica rirungika Pawulo na Baranaba, baherekejwe n’abandi bizera bo muri iryo shengero, ngo baduge i Yerusalemu, kugira ngo bashikirize ico kibazo intumwa n’abakuru b’ishengero. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Nuko ishengero rimaze kubarungika, baca i Foyinike n’i Samariya, biganira abandi bizera ingene Abanyamahanga na bo bizeye Imana, ivyo bitera umunezero mwinshi bene Data bose. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />I Yerusalemu bakiriwe n’ishengero hamwe n’intumwa ziri kumwe n’abakuru b’ishengero, na bo babiganira ivyo Imana yabakoresheje vyose.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ariko bamwe mu bizera bahoze mu mugwi w’Abafarisayo barahaguruka, bavuga bati: “Abanyamahanga bategerezwa gukebwa no gukurikiza Ivyagezwe vya Mose.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Nuko intumwa n’abakuru b’ishengero barakorana bigira hamwe ico kibazo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Inyuma y’impari nyinshi, Petero ava hasi, arababwira ati: “Bene Bata, murazi ko mu misi iheze Imana yantoranije muri mwebwe kugira ngo mbwire Abanyamahanga Ubutumwa Bwiza maze na bo bumve, hanyuma bizere. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Imana, yoyo izi imitima y’abantu, yerekanye ko ibemeye mu kubaha Mpwemu Yera, nk’uko yamuduhaye. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ntiyadutandukanije na bo, kuko yejeje imitima yabo kuko bizeye. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />None rero, ni kubera iki mugomba kugerageza Imana mu kuremeka abigishwa imitwaro twebwe ndetse na ba sogokuruza tutashoboye kwikorera? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ahubwo twizera ko twese dukizwa n’ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ishengero ryose rica riracereza, bumviriza Pawulo na Baranaba, na bo bababwira ivy’ibitangaza n’utwumiza Imana yabakoresheje mu Banyamahanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Baheje kuvuga, Yakobo aca afata ijambo, aravuga ati: “Bene Data, nimuntege amatwi. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni Petero yadusiguriye ingene kuva mu ntango Imana yitayeho Abanyamahanga kugira ngo ibitoranirizemwo abazokwitirirwa izina ryayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Amajambo y’abavugishwa n’Imana aremeranya n’ivyo, kuko handitswe ngo:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Inyuma y’ivyo nzogaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">nsubire nubake inzu ya Dawidi yasambutse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Nzosubira nubake imisaka yaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ndayisanure,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />kugira ngo abandi bantu bose baze barondere Uhoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">barimwo n’Abanyamahanga bitirirwa izina ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">ni ko Uhoraho abikora avuze,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amosi 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />uwabimenyekanishije uhereye kera cane.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ni co gituma mbona tudakwiye kuremera Abanyamahanga bariko bahindukirira Imana. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ahubwo dukwiye kubandikira, tukababwira ko bokwirinda kurya ivyaterekerewe ibigirwamana, bakirinda ingeso mbi z’ubusambanyi, kutarya ibikoko vyanizwe hamwe n’amaraso. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kuko Ivyagezwe vya Mose vyama vyigishwa kuva kera mu masinagogi no mu bisigara, bigasomwa kw’isabato yose.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inama ihambaye y’intumwa yandikira abanyamahanga bizeye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Nuko intumwa n’abakuru b’ishengero, bari kumwe n’ishengero ryose, baca batora bamwe mu banyeshengero, babarungika i Antiyokiya baherekeje Pawulo na Baranaba. Nuko batoranya Yuda ari we Barusaba, na Silasi, bari abarongozi mu bandi bizera. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Maze babarungikana ikete ryavuga ritya:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Twebwe bene So, intumwa n’abakuru b’ishengero,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Turabaramukije mwebwe Abanyamahanga bizera bo muri Antiyokiya, i Siriya n’i Kilikiya.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Twarumvise ko hariho abantu bamwe muri twebwe baje iwanyu tutabatumye, bababwira amajambo abaca ivutu, abahagarika imitima. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ni co gituma twumvikanye gutoranyamwo abo dutuma, bazananye na bene Data dukunda cane, ari bo Baranaba na Pawulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />abagabo bahevye ubuzima bwabo ku bw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kandi turabarungikiye Yuda na Silasi kugira ngo bemeze n’amajambo y’akanwa kabo ivyo tubandikiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Kuko Mpwemu Yera vyamubereye vyiza, kandi natwe bitubera vyiza kutabaremereza ikintu na kimwe kirengeye ivyo tubasaba, ari vyo vy’ibi: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Muze mwirinde kurya ivyaterekerewe ibigirwamana, amaraso canke inyama z’ibikoko binizwe, kandi mwirinde ingeso mbi z’ubusambanyi. Nimwavyirinda muzoba mugize neza.</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Turabasezeye.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Nuko abo bantu baca barabarungika bamanuka muri Antiyokiya, bakoranya ishengero, babashikiriza iryo kete. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Barisomye baranezerwa cane kuko ryarimwo ubutumwa bubatera intege. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Silasi, bari basanzwe ari abavugishwa n’Imana, bongera bababwira amajambo menshi yo kubatera intege no kubakomeza. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nuko bahamara igihe, hanyuma abizera bo muri Antiyokiya barabasezera n’umuhezagiro w’amahoro, maze na bo basubira ku babatumye. [ <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ariko Silasi ahitamwo kugumayo.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Maze Pawulo na Baranaba bagumye muri Antiyokiya, aho bo n’abandi benshi bigishije bongera bavuga Ijambo ry’Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutumvikana kwabaye hagati ya Pawulo na Baranaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Haheze igihe, Pawulo abarira Baranaba ati: “Ingo dusubire mu bisagara twigishijemwo Ijambo ry’Imana, turabe ingene bene Data bifashe.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baranaba yipfuza ko Yohana Mariko ajana na bo, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />ariko Pawulo we abona ko bitabereye ko bojana kuko yigeze kubata i Pamfiliya, ntiyabandanyana na bo mu gikorwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Nuko haba ukutumvikana gukomeye, bituma batandukana. Baranaba ajana na Mariko, bafata ubwato baja i Kupuro. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pawulo ahitamwo kujana na Silasi, bamaze gusengerwa n’abizera bakabaragiza ubuntu bw’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Aca agendagenda muri Siriya no muri Kilikiya, akomeza amashengero yaho.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo atora Timoteyo ngo bajane mu bikorwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Nuko Pawulo ashika i Derube, hanyuma aja i Lusitira, aho hakaba ariho umwigishwa wa Yesu yitwa Timoteyo yaba. Nyina yari Umuyudakazi yizera, ariko se yari Umugiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Yavugwa neza n’abizera b’i Lusitira n’abo muri Ikoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Maze Pawulo yipfuza kujana na we ku rugendo yarimwo, araheza abanza kumukeba ku gitsina kubera Abayuda bo muri ako karere bose bari bazi ko se ari Umugiriki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Mu bisagara bacamwo vyose, bagenda barashikiriza abizera ivyashinzwe n’intumwa n’abakuru b’ishengero b’i Yerusalemu babahimiriza kuvyitondera. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nuko amashengero arakomezwa mu kwizera, kandi igitigiri c’abizera carongerekana umusi ku musi.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yerekwa ivyo kuja i Makedoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pawulo na bagenziwe baca mu ntara za Furugiya na Galatiya, kuko Mpwemu Yera yari yababujije kuvuga ijambo ry’Imana muri Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Bashikiriye urubibe rwa Musiya, bagerageza kwinjira i Bituniya, ariko naho nyene Mpwemu wa Yesu ntiyabemerera. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Nuko baca baca i Musiya bamanuka i Tirowa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mw’ijoro, Pawulo arerekwa abona umuntu w’i Makedoniya ahagaze amubwira ati: “Turakwinginze uze i Makedoniya udutabare.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Pawulo amaze kwerekwa ivyo, duca turitegura ubwo nyene tuja i Makedoniya, kuko twari dutahuye neza ko Imana iduhamagariye kuja kuvugayo Ubutumwa Bwiza.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya yizera, yongera aha indaro intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Nuko tuva i Tirowa mu bwato turaramiriza gushika i Samotirake, ku musi ukurikira naho dushika i Neyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Tuvuye aho, tuja i Filipi, igisagara gikuru c’i Makedoniya cari carigaruriwe n’Abaroma. Ico gisagara tukimaramwo imisi.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ku musi w’Isabato, turasohoka tuja inyuma y’igisagara ku ruzi, twibaza ko dushobora kuronka ahantu ho gusengera. Nuko turicara dutangura kuyaga n’abagore bari bahakoraniye. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Umwe mu bariko baratwumviriza yitwa Lidiya, yava i Tuwatira, akaba yari umudandaza w’impuzu z’agaciro kandi yubaha Imana. Nuko Umwami Imana yugurura umutima wiwe, yakira Ubutumwa Pawulo yariko aravuga. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />We n’abo mu nzu yiwe bamaze kubatizwa, aca aradutumira iwe avuga ati: “Nimba mubona ko ndi uwizera Umwami Yesu, nimuze mube iwanje.” Nuko aratugobera gushika twemeye.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo na Silasi batabwa mw’ibohero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Umusi umwe, turiko turaja ahantu ho gusengera, duhura n’umuguranokazi yari afise impwemu yo kuragura, yatuma amenya ivya kazoza, agacira amahera menshi ba shebuja mu kuragura. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Maze wa mukobwa akurikira Pawulo n’abo twari kumwe bose, asemerera ati: “Aba bantu ni abakozi b’Imana Musumbavyose, baje kubabwira inzira ibashikana ku gakiza.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nuko amara imisi avuga ivyo, gushika aho Pawulo adundumirwa, arahindukira abwira iyo mpwemu ati: “Mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo, ndagutegetse, muvemwo.” Ubwo nyene ya mpwemu ica iramuvamwo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Maze ba shebuja babonye ko bagiye guhomba amahera yahora abinjiriza, bafata Pawulo na Silasi, babajana imbere y’abatware, mu kibanza gikoraniramwo abantu benshi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Babazana imbere y’abacamanza b’Abaroma, bavuga bati: “Aba bantu ni Abayuda, kandi bariko baragumura igisagara, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />bigisha imigenzo twebwe Abaroma tutemerewe gukurikiza.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Abari ngaho bose baca bakurira hasi Pawulo na Silasi, ba bacamanza baca bategeka ko babambura impuzu bakabakubita ibimoko. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Bamaze kubakubita cane, baca babaterera mw’ibohero, bategeka umukuru w’ibohero kubarinda cane kugira ngo ntibatoroke. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kubera iryo tegeko ahawe, aca abashira mu cumba c’ibohero kiri kure, amaguru yabo ayabohera hagati y’ibiti.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Nko mu gicugu hagati, Pawulo na Silasi bariko barasenga bongera baririmba indirimbo zo gutazira Imana, izindi mbohe zarabumva. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ubwo nyene haba nyamugigima ikomeye cane, inyiganyiza amatanguriro y’ibohero. Imiryango y’ibohero iriyugurura, iminyororo yari iboshe imbohe zose izivako. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Umurinzi w’ibohero yikanguye asanga imiryango yose iruguruye, maze asokorora inkota ngo yiyice kuko yibaza ko imbohe zatorotse. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ariko Pawulo arasemerera ati: “Reka ntugire ico wigira, twese turi hano.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Wa murinzi w’ibohero aca atumako urumuri, yiruka mu cumba Pawulo na Silasi barimwo, yikubita imbere y’ibirenge vyabo. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Aca abasohokana hanze, ababaza ati: “Ba nyakwubahwa, nokora iki kugira ngo nkizwe?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Baramwishura bati: “Izere Umwami Yesu, urakizwa, wewe n’abo mu nzu yawe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Baca bamubwira Ijambo ry’Umwami Imana, we n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Iyo saha, muri iryo joro nyene, aca abajana kuboza ibikomere vyabo, maze we n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose baca barabatizwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Nuko abajana iwe, arabagaburira, kandi we n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose buzura umunezero kuko bari bizeye Imana.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bukeye, abacamanza batuma abasoda kuri wa murinzi w’ibohero, ati: “Rekura abo bantu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Wa murinzi w’ibohero aca abarira Pawulo ati: “Abacamanza bategetse ko mwe na Silasi murekurwa. None rero murashobora kwigira. Mugende amahoro.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ariko Pawulo na Silasi baramwishura bati: “Badutonaguriye imbere y’abantu tutanaburanye kandi urubanza rutadutsinze kandi turi Abaroma, bagirako baduta mw’ibohero, none bagomba kuturekura mu mpisho? Ntibishoboka! Nibaze bo nyene ubwabo, babe ari bo batwirekurira.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Ba basoda baca baja kubibwira abacamanza. Bumvise ko Pawulo na Silasi ari Abaroma, baca bagira ubwoba. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Baca baja kubahoyahoya, babasohora ibohero, babaherekeza babinginga ngo bave muri ico gisagara. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Pawulo na Silasi bavuye muri iryo bohero baca baja kwa Lidiya, babonana n’abandi bene Data, babatera intege mu kwizera, baca baragenda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo na Silasi bavuga Ubutumwa i Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Maze Pawulo na Silasi baca muri Amfipoli na Apoloniya, bashika i Tesalonike, ahari isinagogi y’Abayuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pawulo yinjira mw’isinagogi nk’uko yari asanzwe abigenza. Amara amasabato atatu akurikirana aharira na bo ku Vyanditswe Vyera, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />abasigurira yongera abereka ko Kristo yategerezwa kubabazwa no kuzuka mu bapfuye. Akababwira ati: “Uwu Yesu ndiko ndababwira, ni we Kristo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Bamwe mu Bayuda banyurwa n’izo nyigisho, baca bifatanya na Pawulo na Silasi, co kimwe n’igitigiri kinini c’Abagiriki bubaha Imana, hamwe n’abagore b’abanyacubahiro batari bake.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ariko bamwe mu Bayuda bibatera ishari, baca bakoranya abantu b’imburakimazi babakuye mu mabarabara yaho, bagira umugwi munini, hanyuma batangura gutera imigumuko mu gisagara. Nuko binjira mu nzu kwa Yasoni barondera Pawulo na Silasi, kugira ngo babajane imbere y’ikoraniro. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Bababuze baca bafata Yasoni na bamwe muri bene Data, babajana babakwega imbere y’abacamanza, basemerera bati: “Aba bagabo Pawulo na Silasi bateye imigumuko kw’isi hose, none bashitse na hano mu gisagara cacu. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasoni ni we yabahaye indaro, kandi bariko barenga amategeko ya Kayisari, bavuga ko hariho uwundi mwami yitwa Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Abantu bose n’abatware b’igisagara bavyumvise bagira uruhagarara. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Maze abatware b’ico gisagara baka Yasoni n’abari kumwe na we ingwati y’amafaranga, hanyuma barabarekura.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo, Silasi na Timoteyo bashika i Beroya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bugorovye, bene Data barungika Pawulo na Silasi i Beroya. Bashitseyo, binjira mw’isinagogi y’Abayuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Abantu b’i Beroya bari bafise imitima yugurutse kurusha ab’i Tesalonike, kuko bakiriye Ubutumwa Bwiza n’ishaka ryinshi, bakama basesangura Ivyanditswe Vyera umusi ku musi, kugira ngo barabe ko ivyo Pawulo abigisha ari ivy’ukuri. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Nuko benshi mu Bayuda barizera, co kimwe n’abagore n’abagabo b’abanyacubahiro b’Abagiriki.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Maze Abayuda b’i Tesalonike bumvise ko Pawulo ariko yigisha ijambo ry’Imana i Beroya, baca bajayo, bosha abantu gutera imigumuko. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ubwo nyene bene Data baca barungika Pawulo ajana inzira ija ku kiyaga, ariko Silasi na Timoteyo baguma i Beroya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Abaherekeje Pawulo bamushikana muri Atenayi, baca basubira i Beroya. Nuko Pawulo abatuma kuri Silasi na Timoteyo ababwira ko boca bamusangayo badatevye.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyabereye muri Atenayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pawulo akibarindiririye muri Atenayi, agira intuntu mu mutima kubera ibigirwamana vyinshi yabonye muri ico gisagara. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ivyo vyatumye yama aja mw’isinagogi yaho, agaharira n’Abayuda n’Abagiriki bubaha Imana, kandi imisi yose yama aja mu bibanza abantu bahuriramwo, agahaririraho n’abo ahasanze. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Maze umugwi w’abanyabwenge bitwa Abepikureyo n’Abasitoyiko, batangura guharira na we. Bamwe barabaza bati: “Mbega ivyo ariko aradedemba ni ibiki?” Abandi bakavuga bati: “Umenga ariko avuga ivy’imana z’inyamahanga.” Ivyo babivuze kuko Pawulo yariko ababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Yesu n’izuka. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Nuko bamujana imbere y’abagize inama nkuru y’igisagara ari yo bita Areyopago, bamubwira bati: “Twoshobora kumenya izo nyigisho nshasha uzanye? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ivyo uzanye bimeze nk’ivyaduka mu matwi yacu, tugomba kumenya ivyo ari vyo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Mu bisanzwe abantu bo muri Atenayi n’abanyamahanga bahaba bama bahura ata kindi kibahuje atari ukuvuga n’ukwumviriza inkuri nshasha.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Nuko Pawulo ahagarara imbere y’ikoraniro rya Areyopago, avuga ati: “Yemwe bantu bo muri Atenayi, ndabona ko mwubaha cane imana zanyu mu buryo bwose. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kuko igihe nariko ndagendagenda ndaba ivyo mukoresha mu gusenga, nabonye n’igicaniro canditsweko ngo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="ACT 17:23">
    <char style="sc">Ic’imana Itazwi.</char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:23">None rero iyo musenga mutazi ni yo ngira ndababwire.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Imana yaremye isi n’ibiyirimwo ni yo Mwami y’ijuru n’isi kandi ntiba mu nsengero zubatswe n’abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ntikeneye ko abantu bayifasha nk’aho umenga hariho ico ibuze, kuko ari yo nyene iha abantu ubuzima no guhumeka hamwe n’ibindi vyose. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Mu ruvyaro rw’umuntu umwe yakuyemwo amoko yose iyakwiza kw’isi yose. Ni yo yabashiriyeho igihe bazobaho, ibashingira n’imbibe z’aho bazoba. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Imana yakoze ivyo kugira ngo abantu bayirondere, kandi kugira ngo kumbure nibagerageza kuyirondera baze bayibone, n’aho itari kure y’umuntu n’umwe muri twebwe. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ni kubera yo tubayeho, tukagendagenda, kandi tukagira ubuzima. Nk’uko bamwe mu bahinga banyu babivuze, ‘Turi uruvyaro rwayo.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />None rero, ko turi uruvyaro rwayo, ntidukwiye kwiyumvira ko Imana imeze nk’igishushanyo gikozwe mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza canke mw’ibuye, biciye mu buhinga n’amaboko vy’abantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ibihe abantu batari bwamenye Imana, iyo Mana nta co ibibagirizako, ariko ubu ihamagarira abantu bose aho bari hose kwihana, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />kuko yashinze umusi izocira imanza isi mu bugororotsi, ikoresheje umuntu yagenye. Ivyo Imana yabigaragaje mu maso ya bose mu kumuzura imukuye mu bapfuye.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Bumvise ivyo kuzuka kw’abapfuye, bamwe baritwengera, ariko abandi bavuga bati: “Tuzosubira kukwumviriza kuri ivyo ikindi gihe.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Nuko Pawulo aca ava muri iryo koraniro. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ariko bamwe mu bari aho baca bahinduka abigishwa ba Pawulo, barizera. Muri abo harimwo Diyonisiyo, umwe mu bagize inama ya Areyopago, hamwe n’umugore yitwa Damari, n’abandi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashika i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo Pawulo aca ava muri Atenayi aja i Korinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Aho hari Umuyuda yitwa Akwilasi, imvukira y’i Ponto, yari aheruka kuva mu Butaliyano ari kumwe n’umugore wiwe Pirisila, kuko Kayisari Korode yari yategetse ko Abayuda bose birukanwa i Roma. Maze Pawulo aca aja kubarondera. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Bitumwe n’uko bari basangiye umwuga wo kujisha amahema, yaciye abana na bo, barakorana. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Ku misi yose y’Isabato Pawulo yama aja mw’isinagogi guharira n’Abayuda n’Abagiriki, akagerageza kubemeza.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silasi na Timoteyo bashitse i Korinto bavuye i Makedoniya, Pawulo aca ashira umwanya wiwe wose mu gikorwa co kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, ashingira intahe Abayuda ko Yesu ari we Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ariko abonye ko Abayuda bamuhaririza bakanamutuka, aca akunkumura impuzu ziwe, ababwira ati: “Amaraso yanyu azobe ku gatwe kanyu. Jewe kuri ivyo ndera. Uhereye ubu ngiye kwigisha Abanyamahanga.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Nuko aca ava mw’isinagogi aja ku nzu yari i ruhande, kwa Titiyo Yusito, umuntu yubaha Imana. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisipo, umukuru w’isinagogi n’abo mu nzu yiwe bose bizera Umwami Imana, kandi ab’i Korinto benshi bumvirije Pawulo barizera, bongera barabatizwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Umusi umwe hari mw’ijoro, Umwami Imana abarira Pawulo mu ndoto ati: <char style="wj">“Ntutinye! Bandanya uvuga, ntucereze,</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" /><char style="wj">kuko ndi kumwe na we. Nta n’umwe azogufata ngo akugirire nabi, kuko mfise abantu benshi muri kino gisagara.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Nuko Pawulo aca amara umwaka n’amezi atandatu i Korinto yigisha ijambo ry’Imana.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Igihe Galiyo yatwarira Kayisari muri Akaya, Abayuda bahuje umutima n’inama kugwanya Pawulo, bamutwara ku bacamanza <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />bamwagiriza bati: “Uwu mugabo ariko yemeza abantu gusenga Imana mu buryo butemewe n’ivyagezwe.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ariko Pawulo agira afate ijambo, Galiyo abwira Abayuda ati: “Yemwe Bayuda, iyo muba mwariko mumwagiriza ikibi canke icaha gikomeye, vyari kwumvikana ko nkwiye gufata umwanya nkabumviriza. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ariko ko numva ari impari zifatiye ku majambo, amazina n’amategeko vyanyu, nimurwicire mwebwe nyene. Sinshobora guca imanza nk’izo.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Aca arabirukana bava mu nzu y’ubucamanza. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Na bo baca basimbira kuri Sositene umukuru w’isinagogi, bamukubitira aho nyene imbere y’inzu y’ubucamanza. Ariko Galiyo ntiyavyitaho.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo asubira muri Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Pawulo amara igihe aba i Korinto, hanyuma asigayo bene Data, afata ubwato aja muri Siriya, aherekejwe na Pirisila na Akwilasi. Imbere yo gufata urugendo, Pawulo yabanje guca i Kenkireya aho yimweshereje umushatsi kubera isezerano yari yarasezeranye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ryari isezerano ry’ubunaziri yari yaragize.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bashitse muri Efeso, Pawulo abasiga ngaho, we aragenda yinjira mw’isinagogi y’Abayuda guharira na bo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bamusavye ngo amarane na bo iyindi misi, ntiyabemerera. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ariko mu kubasezera ababwira ati: “Nzogaruka hanyuma Imana niyabishaka.” Nuko afata ubwato ava muri Efeso, <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />ashika i Kayisariya. Avayo aduga i Yerusalemu kuramutsa ishengero, hanyuma amanuka muri Antiyokiya h’i Siriya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Amaze igihe gito muri Antiyokiya, avayo agendera ahantu hatandukanye mu ntara za Galatiya na Furugiya, akomeza abizera bose.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ico gihe Umuyuda yitwa Apolo, yari yavukiye muri Alegizanderiya, ashika muri Efeso. Yari umuntu azi kuvuga neza, kandi yari afise ubumenyi bwinshi mu Vyanditswe Vyera. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Yari yarigishijwe inzira y’Umwami Yesu, kandi n’aho yari yabatijwe umubatizo wa Yohana gusa, yigisha ivya Kristo ashize amanga mu kuri kwose. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Pirisila na Akwilasi bumvise ingene yigisha mw’isinagogi ashize amanga, baca bamujana iwabo, babandanya kumusigurira neza inzira y’Imana.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo yipfuje kuja muri Akaya, bene Data bamutera intege, batako bandikira ikete abigishwa baho kugira baze bamwakire. Ashitseyo agirira ikimazi kinini abari barizeye ku bw’ubuntu bw’Imana, <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />kuko akoresheje Ivyanditswe Vyera, yatsinda ku mugaragaro ivyiyumviro vy’Abayuda bamuhaririza, akabemeza ko Yesu ari we Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashika muri Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo akiri i Korinto, Pawulo afata inzira ica mu gihugu hagati, aragenda ashika muri Efeso, ahasanga abigishwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Arababaza ati: “Mwarakiriye Mpwemu Yera igihe mwizera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Baramwishura bati: “Haba na mba. Mbere ntitwari bwumve n’uko Mpwemu Yera abaho.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Maze Pawulo arababaza ati: “None mwabatijwe uwuhe mubatizo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Baramwishura bati: “Umubatizo wa Yohana.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pawulo arababwira ati: “Umubatizo wa Yohana wari uwo kwihana. Yahamagarira abantu kwizera uwagira aze inyuma yiwe, uwo na we ni Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bavyumvise, baca babatizwa mw’izina ry’Umwami Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pawulo abarambitseko ibiganza, Mpwemu Yera aca abazako, batangura kuvuga izindi ndimi no kuvugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Abari aho bari nk’abagabo cumi na babiri.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pawulo aca yinjira mw’isinagogi, amara amezi atatu yigisha ashize amanga, aharira n’abantu akabemeza ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ariko bamwe bakomantaza imitima banka kwizera, batangura kunegura ku mugaragaro inzira y’Umwami Yesu. Nuko Pawulo aca ava muri iyo sinagogi, agenda ajanye na bamwe mu bamaze kwizera, maze abandanya avuganira na bo mu nyubakwa y’uwitwa Turano yigishirizamwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Amara imyaka ibiri abikora uko, gushika Abayuda n’Abagiriki bose baba muri Aziya bumvise ijambo ry’Umwami Imana.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Imana ikoresha Pawulo ibitangaza bidasanzwe, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />gushika aho n’igitambara canke impuzu yakozeko abantu babikoza ku bagwaye, bagakira ingwara n’ababoshwe n’impwemu mbi zikabavamwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Maze Abayuda bamwe bigenera kugenda hirya no hino, bagerageza kwirukana impwemu mbi ngo zive mu bantu bakoresheje izina ry’Umwami Yesu. Bavuga bati: “Mw’izina rya Yesu, umwe Pawulo yigisha, ndagutegetse muvemwo!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Kandi hari n’abahungu indwi b’Umuyuda yitwa Sikewa, umwe mu baherezi bakuru, bakora nk’uko. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Umusi umwe impwemu mbi irabishura iti: “Yesu ndamuzi, na Pawulo ndamuzi. None mwebwe muri ba nde?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Wa muntu yarimwo impwemu mbi aca abasimbirako, abarusha inkomezi, arabakubita gushika aho bahunga inzu barimwo bari gusa, bavirirana.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Abayuda n’Abagiriki baba muri Efeso bamenye iyo nkuru, bose batekerwa n’ubwoba, maze Izina ry’Umwami Yesu rishirwa hejuru. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Maze benshi mu bari bizeye baraza, baratura bongera bavugira ku mugaragaro ivyo bakoze. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Abahora bakora ivy’amareba, bazana ibitabu vyabo babiturira ku mugaragaro. Igiciro c’ivyo bitabu, cangana ibiceri vy’ifeza ibihumbi mirongo itanu. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Maze ijambo ry’Umwami Imana rikwiragira henshi kandi rigira ubushobozi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Pawulo, asunitswe na Mpwemu, aca afata ingingo yo kuja i Yerusalemu, aciye i Makedoniya no muri Akaya. Yavuga ati: “Mvuyeyo, ntegerezwa guca nja i Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Aca arungika babiri mu bamufasha ibikorwa, ari bo Timoteyo na Erasito, baja i Makedoniya, na we aca amara ikindi gihe gito muri Aziya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imigumuko yabereye muri Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Muri iyo misi nyene haduka imigumuko ivuye ku bijanye n’Inzira y’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Iyo migumuko yadutse ivuye ku mugabo yitwa Demetiriyusi yari afise umwuga wo gucura ibintu mw’ifeza, ni na we yakora mw’ifeza utunyabugoro tw’ikigirwamanakazi Arutemi, kandi uwo mwuga wazanira inyungu nini abawukora. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Nuko akoranya abandi bacuzi bari basangiye umwuga, ababwira ati: “Bagenzi, murazi ko uwu mwuga ari wo udutungishije. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />None murumva ingene wa mugabo Pawulo yemeje abantu, akazimiza benshi muri Efeso, ndetse no muri Aziya yose. Avuga ko imana zikozwe n’abantu atari imana na mba. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kandi urudandazwa rwacu si rwo rwonyene ruzota agaciro, ariko n’ingoro y’imanakazi ihambaye Arutemi ntizosubira kwubahwa, ndetse na Arutemi, ari yo manakazi isengwa muri Aziya no kw’isi yose, izoba yambuwe icubahiro c’ubumana bwayo.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bavyumvise barashavura cane, batangura gusemerera bati: “Arutemi, imana y’Abanyefeso, irahambaye!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mu mwanya muto igisagara cose cuzura imigumuko. Abantu bose biruka baja mu kibaza c’ibirori, bagenda barakwega Gayo na Arisitariko, abari bagendanye na Pawulo kuva i Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pawulo agomvye guseruka imbere y’ikoraniro, abigishwa baramwankira. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Na bamwe mu batware b’iyo ntara, bari abagenzi ba Pawulo, bamutumako bamwinginga ngo ntahirahire ngo yinjire muri ico kibanza c’ibirori.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ariko ikoraniro rirazazanirwa kuko bamwe bayogora bavuga ibi, abandi bakayogora bavuga ibindi. Ndetse benshi muri bo ntibari bazi n’igituma bari ngaho. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Bamwe mw’ikoraniro bumvisha Alegizandere, uwo Abayuda bashize imbere, ivyariko biraba. Nuko na we arabamama kugira ngo asigure ivyo nyene vyariko biraba. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Babonye ko ari Umuyuda, baca badugiriza urwamo rimwe bamara nk’amasaha abiri bavuga bati: “Arutemi, imana y’Abanyefeso, irahambaye!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Umunyamabanga w’igisagara arabahoyahoya, ababwira ati: “Yemwe bantu bo muri Efeso, abantu bose barazi ko mu gisagara ca Efeso ariho hari ingoro ya Arutemi, n’igishusho cayo cakorotse kiva mw’ijuru. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />None rero, ko ivyo ata wubihakana, Nimutekane, ntimuhave mukora ivyo mutiyumviriyeko. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Aba bantu mwabazanye ngaha kandi ata na kimwe bivye mu ngoro canke ngo batuke imana yacu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Nimba Demetiriyusi n’abandi bacuzi bagenziwe bafise ivyo babagiriza, sentare ziruguruye, kandi n’abacamanza barahari, barabitwarira. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Hakaba hariho n’ibindi mwipfuza gushikiriza, bizotunganirizwa mw’ikoraniro ribijejwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Erega turashobara kwagirizwa imigumuko kubera ibibaye uno musi. Kandi nta co twokwireguza kuko nta kintu na kimwe gifadika cabitumye.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca acura iryo koraniro.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo aja i Makedoniya no mu Bugiriki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ya migumuko iheze, Pawulo aca atumako abigishwa abatera intege, hanyuma arabasezera, afata urugendo aja i Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nuko aca muri iyo ntara yose aremesha abizera n’inyigisho nyinshi zo kubatera intege, maze ashika mu Bugiriki, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />ahamara amezi atatu. Agira afate ubwato ngo aje muri Siriya, amenya ko hariho Abayuda bamugiriye inama, aca afata ingingo yo gusubira i Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Maze aca ajana na Sopatero mwene Puro w’i Beroya, na Arisitariko na Sekundo b’i Tesalonike, na Gayo w’i Derube, na Timoteyo, na Tukiko na Tirofimo bo muri Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Abo baba baragenda, baturindirira i Tirowa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Natwe tuva i Filipi inyuma y’imisi mikuru y’imitsima itarimwo umwambiro, tubasanga i Tirowa haheze imisi itanu, duca tuhamara imisi indwi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo agarurira ubuzima Eyutuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ku mugoroba w’umusi w’Isabato duhurira hamwe ngo dusangire ingaburo y’Umwami, hanyuma Pawulo arabigisha gushika ijoro rigeze hagati kuko bwaca agenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Icumba co hejuru twari twakoraniyemwo, carimwo amatara menshi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Maze umusore yitwa Eyutuko yari yicaye kw’idirisha, aremerwa n’itiro ryinshi Pawulo ariko arigisha. Amaze gusinzira cane, arakoroka avuye ku nzu yo hejuru igira gatatu, bamutora yapfuye. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Maze Pawulo arururuka, amwubamako, aramubumbatira, avuga ati: “Ntimuhagarike imitima, ni muzima!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Hanyuma aca asubira hejuru, basangira ingaburo y’Umwami kandi iheze Pawulo aca abandanya yigisha gushika bukeye, ahejeje aragenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Nuko abantu batahana uwo musore ari muzima, kandi batewe intege cane.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo asezera abakuru b’ishengero ryo muri Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Nuko tuva aho, twitangira Pawulo imbere, dufata ubwato butujana muri Aso, aho twategerezwa guhurira na Pawulo. Yari yabiteguye uko kuko we yashaka kujayo ajanye ibarabara. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Adusanze muri Aso, twaciye tujana mu bwato gushika i Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Bukeye tubandanya urugendo, dushika hafi y’izinga Kiyosi. Ku musi ukurikira, turashishikara dushika i Samosi, maze bukeye dushika i Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pawulo aca ahitamwo kubandanya adahagaze muri Efeso, kuko yanka kumara uwundi mwanya muri Aziya. Yariko yihutira ko, hamwe bimushobokeye, yoshika i Yerusalemu ku musi wa Pentekoti.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Tukiri i Mileto, Pawulo aca atumako abakuru b’ishengero ryo muri Efeso, kugira ngo baze babonane. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Bashitse, arababwira ati: “Murazi ingene nabanye namwe uhereye ku musi wa mbere nashikiye muri Aziya gushika n’uno musi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Nakoreye Umwami Imana nciye bugufi kandi ndira cane, nihanganira amageragezwa menshi avuye ku mitego y’Abayuda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Murazi ko mu vyashobora kubagirira ikimazi vyose ata na kimwe nabahishije, uhubwo navuze ubutumwa nongera nigisha mu makoraniro no mu nzu zanyu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nigishije Abayuda n’Abagiriki ko bakwiye kwihana bagahindukirira Imana mu kwizera Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />None rero, ngoberewe na Mpwemu Yera, ngiye i Yerusalemu, ariko sinzi ibizonshikira ndi yo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ico nzi gusa ni uko, mu bisagara vyose ncamwo, Mpwemu Yera aguma amburira ko umunyororo n’amakuba bindindiriye. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ariko mbona ko ubuzima bwanje atari ikintu c’agaciro kanini, ico nshaka ni kunonosora urugendo rwanje, no gusozera neza igikorwa Umwami Yesu yampaye co kubwira abantu Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’ubuntu bw’Imana.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />None rero ndazi ko mwebwe abo nabwiye Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Ubwami ata n’umwe azosubira kumbona. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ni co gituma ndabamenyesha uwu musi ko nera ku maraso yanyu mwese, ko atazomparurwako. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kuko ata na kimwe mu vyo Imana yashaka ko mumenya vyose ntababwiye. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Nuko rero mwirinde mwebwe ubwanyu mwongere murinde n’ubusho Mpwemu Yera yabahaye ngo mububere abungere. Muragire ishengero ry’Imana, iryo yaguze amaraso y’umwana wayo. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ndazi ko ninamara kugenda hazokwaduka abigisha b’ibinyoma bameze nk’amabingira y’inkazi, bazinjira muri mwebwe, maze batikize ubusho. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Mbere no muri mwebwe nyene hariho abazokwadukana inyigisho zo kugoramika ukuri kugira ngo bikwegereko abigishwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nuko rero mube maso kandi mwibuke ko mu myaka itatu tumaranye ntigeze mpengeshanya, ijoro n’umurango, kuburira umuntu wese muri mwebwe n’amarira menshi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Ubu rero ndabaragije Imana n’ijambo ry’ubuntu bwayo, ryo rishobora kubakomeza mu kwizera no kubaha kuragwa ivyiza hamwe n’abera. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Sinigeze nipfuza ifeza, inzahabu canke impuzu vy’umuntu n’umwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Namwe ubwanyu murazi ko nakoresheje amaboko yanje nkibeshaho nkongera nkabeshaho n’abo twagendana. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Muri vyose, naberetse akarorero keza ko dutegerezwa gukora cane kugira ngo dufashe abatishoboye, twibuka amajambo y’Umwami Yesu ubwiwe, we yavuze ati: <char style="wj">‘Hari umugisha mu gutanga kurusha mu guhabwa.’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo, aca apfukama hamwe na bo barasenga. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bose baraturikisha bararira, bamusezera bamugumbira. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Icabababaje kurusha ibindi, ni uko yari yababwiye ko batazosubira kumubona. Nuko baca baramuherekeza gushika ku bwato.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo aja Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Tumaze gusezera abakuru bo muri Efeso no gutandukana na bo, duca twurira ubwato tuja i Kosi. Ku musi ukurikira tuja i Rodo, hanyuma tuvayo tuja i Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Tuhashitse tuhasanga ubwato buja i Foyinike, duca turabwurira turagenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Dushitse hafi y’izinga ryitwa Kupuro, turisiga i bubamfu, tugenda dutumbereye i Siriya, maze dushika i Tiro, aho ubwato twarimwo bwategerezwa kwururukiriza ivyo bwari butwaye. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Twururutse tuhasanga abigishwa baho, duca tumarana na bo imisi indwi. Baca bavugishwa na Mpwemu Yera ko Pawulo adakwiye kubandanya urwo rugendo ruja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ariko iyo ndwi iheze, duca turabandanya urugendo. Bene Data bose, bari kumwe n’abagore n’abana, baraduherekeza kuva mu gisagara gushika ku nkengera y’ikiyaga. Tuhashitse, turapfukama turasenga. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Tumaze gusezerana, duca twurira ubwato, na bo basubira iwabo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Nuko tubandanya urugendo kuva i Tiro, dushika i Putolemiya, aho twamaze umusi umwe turamutsa bene Data. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Bukeye turabandanya dushika i Kayisariya, dushikira kwa Filipo umuvugabutumwa, umwe muri bamwe ndwi batoranywa i Yerusalemu ngo bakore igikorwa co kugaburira imfungurwa abapfakazi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Yari afise abakobwa bane batararongorwa, bafise ingabire yo kuvugishwa n’Imana.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Tuhamaze imisi, haza uwuvugishwa n’Imana yitwa Agabo, yari amanutse ava i Yudaya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ashitse aho turi, afata umukanda wa Pawulo, awibohesha amaboko n’amaguru, avuga ati: “Mpwemu Yera avuze ati: ‘Uku ni ko Abayuda b’i Yerusalemu bazoboha nyene uwu mukanda, hanyuma bamurekurire mu maboko y’Abanyamahanga.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Tuvyumvise, twe n’ababa aho twinginga Pawulo tumusaba ngo ntashishikare urugendo ruja i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Pawulo aratwishura ati: “Ni kuki murira, mumbabariza umutima? Siniteguriye kubohwa gusa, ahubwo niteguriye no gupfira i Yerusalemu ku bw’izina ry’Umwami Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Tubonye tudashobora kumugondoza turamureka, tuvuga tuti: “Ivyo Imana ishaka bibe ari vyo biba.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Inyuma y’ivyo duca turitegura, tuduga i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bamwe mu bigishwa b’i Kayisariya baraduherekeza badushikana kwa Munasoni, aho twategerezwa kurara. Uwo Munasoni yava i Kupuro kandi yari umwe mu ba bantu bambere bizeye Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo na bagenziwe bashika i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Dushitse i Yerusalemu, bene Data batwakirana umunezero. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Bukeye Pawulo ajana natwe tuja kuraba Yakobo, kandi n’abandi bakuru b’ishengero ni ho bari bari. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pawulo arabaramutsa, abiganira ido n’ido ry’ivyo Imana yamukoresheje mu Banyamahanga mu gikorwa ciwe.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bavyumvise bashima Imana, hanyuma bamubwira bati: “Mwene Data, ehe raba ingene ibihumbi vyinshi vy’Abayuda bizeye, kandi bose buzuye ishaka ryo kwubahiriza Ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ariko bumvise ko wigisha Abayuda bose baba mu Banyamahanga ngo bave mu vyagezwe vya Mose, kandi ngo ntibakebe abana babo, canke ngo babeho nk’uko imigenzo y’Abayuda ibitegeka. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />None tubigenze dute? Nta nkeka bazokwumva ko waje. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Turagusavye rero ukore ico tukubwira. Hari abagabo bane bari kumwe natwe bagize isezerano imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Jana na bo, ugirane na bo umugenzo w’ukwihumanura, kandi ubarihire n’amahera kugira ngo bimoshe. Gutyo abantu bose bazobona ko ivyo bakwumviseko atari vyo, ariko ko nawe ubayeho witondera ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Naho ku vyerekeye abanyamahanga bizera, nibakurikize ingingo twarabandikiye mw’ikete: birinde kurya ivyaterekerewe ibigirwamana, amaraso canke inyama z’ibikoko binizwe, n’ingeso mbi z’ubusambanyi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Bukeye Pawulo aca ajana n’abo bantu, yihumanurira hamwe na bo, hanyuma aja mu rusengero kumenyesha umusi umugenzo wo kwihumanura uzorangirirako, maze ibimazi bigatangwa ku bw’umwumwe muri bo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo afatirwa mu rusengero i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Imisi indwi y’umugenzo wo kwihumanura igira irangire, Abayuda bamwe bo muri Aziya babona Pawulo mu rusengero. Baca bagumura ikoraniro ryose, baramufata. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Barasemerera bati: “Yemwe Bisirayeli, dutabare! Uwu ni wa mugabo agenda arigisha abantu bose aho aciye hose, atyoza ubwoko bwacu, ivyagezwe n’uru rusengero. Ikigeretseko, yazanye Abagiriki mu rusengero, ahumanya iki kibanza cera.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Ivyo babivuze kubera bari baheruka kubona Umunyefeso yitwa Tirofimo ari kumwe na Pawulo mu gisagara, baca bibaza ko yamujanye no mu rusengero.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Maze umugumuko ukwira igisagara cose, abantu baza bariruka bavuye mu mihingo yose. Bafata Pawulo, bamukwegera inyuma y’urusengero, ubwo nyene imiryango yarwo ica irugarwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Bagira bamwice, inkuru ica ishikira umukuru w’abasoda b’Abaroma ko igisagara ca Yerusalemu cose kiri mu mugumuko. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Aca akoranya bamwe mu batwara imigwi y’abasoda ijana n’abo batwara, baca banyuragirana hagati mu bantu. Abariko batera imigumuko babonye uwo mukuru w’abasoda n’ingabo ziwe, baca barahagarika gukubita Pawulo.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda aca araseruka, aramufata, ategeka ko bamubohesha iminyororo ibiri, hanyuma abaza uwo ari we n’ico yakoze. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Bamwe mw’isinzi ryari aho bagasemerera bavuga bimwe, abandi bakavuga ibindi. Kubera ko uwo mukuru w’abasoda atashobora kumenya ukuri bitumwe n’urwamo rw’abantu, ategeka ko Pawulo ajanwa mw’ikambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pawulo ashitse ku ngazi z’amabuye ziduga mw’ikambi, imigumuko iba myinshi cane, bica biba ngombwa ko abasoda bamutwara bamureruye. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Isinzi ry’abari bamukurikiye bagenda barasemerera bati: “Mwice! Mwice!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yiregura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Abasoda bashikanye Pawulo mw’ikambi, abaza wa mukuru w’abasoda ati: “Noshobora kugira ico ndababaza?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Na we aramwishura ati: “Urazi Ikigiriki? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Wewe nturi wa Munyegiputa yatera umugararizo mu misi iheze, agatwara mu bugaragwa abicanyi ibihumbi bine?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pawulo arishura ati: “Ndi Umuyuda w’i Taruso muri Kilikiya, umunyagisagara kidasanzwe. Ndakwinginze unyemerere ngire ico mbwira aba bantu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda yemerera Pawulo, na we ahagarara ku ngazi, arabamama ngo batekane. Habaye agacerere, aca avugana na bo mu rurimi rwabo rw’Igiheburayo.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Arababwira ati: “Bavukanyi namwe bavyeyi, nimwumvirize ukwiregura kwanje.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bumvise avugana na bo mu Giheburayo, baca barahora, haba agacerere kenshi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Pawulo aca arabandanya ati: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Ndi Umuyuda, navukiye i Taruso muri Kilikiya, ariko nakuriye hano i Yerusalemu, nigishwa na Gamaliyeli kwitondera ivyagezwe vya ba sogokuruza mu kuri kwavyo kwose. Nagize ishaka ryinshi ryo kwubaha Imana nk’uko namwe muri hano uwu musi muyubaha. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Nahama abakurikira inzira y’Umwami Yesu gushika naho bamwe bapfa, ngafata abagore n’abagabo nkabata mw’ibohero. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Ivyo umuherezi mukuru n’abagize Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda bose bashobora kubishingira intahe. Mbere ni na bo bampaye amakete nshira Abayuda benewacu b’i Damasiko, maze njayo gufata abizera baho ngo ndabazane i Yerusalemu ari imbohe, kugira ngo bahanwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Nk’igihe c’isaha zitandatu z’umurango, ndiko ndegereza i Damasiko, umuco uvuye mw’ijuru undasira impande zose. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Maze ngwa hasi hanyuma numva ijwi rimbarira riti: <char style="wj">‘Sawuli! Sawuli! Uriko umpamira iki?’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nanje ndabaza nti: ‘Uri nde ga Mwami?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">Rya jwi riranyishura riti: <char style="wj">‘Ndi Yesu w’i Nazareti, uwo uriko urahama.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Abo twari kumwe barabona umuco ariko ntibumva ijwi ry’uwo twariko turavugana.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nanje ndamubaza nti: ‘None nkore iki ga Mwami?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">Umwami Yesu aranyishura ati: <char style="wj">‘Haguruka uje i Damasiko, ni ho bazokubwira ivyo utegekanirijwe kuzokora.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Abo twagendanye baca bamfata ukuboko bantwara i Damasiko, kuko wa muco mwinshi wari watumye mpuma amaso.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Muri ico gisagara hariho umuntu yitwa Ananiya. Yari umuntu yubaha Imana, akitondera ivyagezwe, kandi Abayuda bose baho bamushingira intahe nziza. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Nuko aza kundaba, ampagarara i ruhande ambwira ati: ‘Mwene Data Sawuli, humuka!’ Ako kanya nyene nca ndahumuka, ndamubona.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Maze aravuga ati: ‘Imana ya ba sogokuruza yagutoranirije kumenya ivyo igomba, kubona wa Mugororotsi, no kwumva ijwi ryiwe. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Uzomubera icabona co gushingira intahe ivyo wabonye n’ivyo wumvise imbere y’abantu bose. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />None ni igiki kigutebeje? Va hasi ubatizwe, wambaze izina ryiwe, ubone kwozwa ivyaha vyawe.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Maze kugaruka i Yerusalemu, umusi umwe ndi mu rusengero ndiko ndasenga nderekwa, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />mbona Umwami Yesu ambwira ati: <char style="wj">‘Ihute uve i Yerusalemu kuko abaho batazokwemera intahe unshingira.’</char><verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nca ndamwishura nti: ‘Mwami, aba bantu barazi ko naciye mu masinagogi yose ngata mw’ibohero nkongera ngakubitisha abakwizera. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Kandi igihe amaraso ya Setefano uwagushingira intahe yaseseka, ni ho nari, nemeza ko yicwa, mfatiye impuzu abariko baramwica.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Aca arambwira ati: <char style="wj">‘Genda, nzogutuma kure, mu Banyamahanga.’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashirwa mw’ibohero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Gushika kuri ayo majambo, abantu bari bakiriko baramwumviriza. Maze baca batangura gushira urwamo hejuru bati: “Mukure kw’isi! Uwo ntakwiye kubaho!”<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bagishira urwamo hejuru, bata impuzu bongera basurira umukungugu hejuru, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />wa mukuru w’abasoda aca ategeka ko Pawulo ajanwa mw’ikambi, bakamusambisha bamukubita kugira ngo bamenye igituma abantu bose bahagurukiye rimwe kumwiyamiriza. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Bamaze kumuboha ngo bamukubite, Pawulo aca abaza umukuru w’abasoda ijana yari ahagaze aho ati: “Mbega biremewe n’amategeko gukubita Umuroma, ata rubanza rwamutsinze?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Na we avyumvise aca aja kuri wa mukuru wabo amubwira ati: “Mbega ubigenza gute? Erega wa mugabo ni Umuroma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Wa mukuru avyumvise aca aja kubaza Pawulo ati: “Mbwira, uri Umuroma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Pawulo aramwishura ati: “Egome ndi we.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Wa mukuru ati: “Na jewe ndi we, kandi natanze amahera menshi kugira ngo ndonke ubwo bwenegihugu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Pawulo na we amubwira ati: “Ariko jeho navutse ndi Umuroma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Abagira bamusambishe baca basubira inyuma ubwo nyene. Na wa mukuru w’abasoda agira ubwoba kuko yabohesheje Pawulo, kandi ari Umuroma.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo arengutswa imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Bukeye bwaho, uwo mukuru w’abasoda akoranya abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abagize Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda. Yashaka kumenya neza ico Abayuda bagiriza Pawulo. Nuko aca aramubohora, amuhagarika imbere yabo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Maze Pawulo ahanga amaso Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda ababwira ati: “Bavukanyi, gushika uno musi, namye ngendera imbere y’Imana, ata jwi rinyagiriza ikibi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ananiya, umuherezi mukuru, aca ategeka abari hafi ya Pawulo ko bamukubita ku munwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Pawulo nawe aca avuga ati: “Imana izogukubita, wa ndyadya we umeze nk’igihome gisize irangi ryera! Uriko uncira urubanza wisunga ivyagezwe none ubirenzeko utegeka ko bankubita!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Abari bahagaze i ruhande ya Pawulo baca bamubwira bati: “Nta soni! Urubahutse gutuka umuherezi mukuru w’Imana!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pawulo arabishura ati: “Bavukanyi, sinamenye ko ari umuherezi mukuru; kuko handitswe ngo: ‘Ntimukavuge nabi n’umwe mu baganza ubwoko bwanyu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kuvayo 22:28</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pawulo amenye ko mu bari ngaho harimwo Abasadukayo n’Abafarisayo, aca abwira abagize iyo Nama Nkuru y’Abayuda ati: “Bavukanyi, jewe ndi Umufarisayo, kandi na data ni Umufarisayo. Aha ndiko ncirwa urubanza kuko mfise ivyizigiro ko hariho ukuzuka kw’abapfuye.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Avuze uko, haca haduka ukutumvikana hagati y’Abafarisayo n’Abasadukayo, ikoraniro rica ryicamwo kubiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Mu bisanzwe, Abasadukayo bavuga ko ata kuzuka kubaho, ko ata bamarayika canke impwemu bibaho, ariko Abafarisayo bo bemera ko ivyo vyose bibaho.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Maze urwamo ruba rwinshi, hanyuma bamwe mu bigisha b’Ivyagezwe b’Abafarisayo bava hasi bavuga bashize amanga bati: “Uwu muntu twebwe tubona ata caha kimwagira. Nta wubizi, ko atoba yaravuganye n’impwemu canke n’umumarayika!” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Impari ziba nyinshi gushika aho wa mukuru w’abasoda agira ubwoba, yibaza ko bahava batabagura Pawulo. Aca ategeka abasoda ngo bamanuke bamunyakure, bamuhungishirize mw’ikambi.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Mw’ijoro, Umwami Yesu araza ahagarara i ruhande ya Pawulo, amubwira ati: <char style="wj">“Humura! Nk’uko wanshingiye intahe i Yerusalemu, ni ko uzonshingira intahe n’i Roma.”</char><verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagira umugambi wo kwica Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Bukeye Abayuda bagira inama, bashirako n’indahiro ko batazogira ico barya canke ico banywa batarica Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Abari muri iyo nama barenga mirongo ine. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Nuko baja ku baherezi bakurubakuru n’abatware, bababwira bati: “Twarahiye ko ata co turya tutarica Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />None rero, mwebwe n’Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda, nimusabe umukuru w’abasoda amubarungikire, mumubwire ko mugomba kumenya ivyiwe neza. Natwe turiteguye guca tumwica atarashika ngaha.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ariko umuhungu wa mushiki wa Pawulo yumva iyo nama, aca yiruka kw’ikambi abibarira Pawulo.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Pawulo aca abarira umwe mu bakuru b’abasoda ijana ati: “Jana uwu musore ku mukuru w’abasoda; arafise ico agomba kumubwira.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Na we aca aramujana kuri wa mukuru w’abasoda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Amubwira ati: “Pawulo, umwe ari mw’ibohero, ansavye ngo nzane uwu musore, kuko afise ico agomba kukubwira.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda aca afata ukuboko wa musore, amwinjiza mu nzu, aramubaza ati: “Ugomba kumbarira iki?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Wa musore aca avuga ati: “Abayuda bagiye inama yo kugusaba ngo urungike Pawulo imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda ejo, babesha ko hari amakuru bashaka kumubaza. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ntuvyemere kuko muri bo hari abagabo barenga mirongo ine bagomba kumutegera. Kandi basezeranye ko badasubira kurya canke ngo banywe bataramwica. Ubu bamaze kwitegura, barindiriye ko wemera gusa kumurungika.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda aca arungika wa musore, amwihanikirije ati: “Ntihagire n’umwe ubwira ko ibi wabimbwiye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barungika Pawulo i Kayisariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda aca ahamagara abakuru babiri b’abasoda ijana-jana, ababwira ati: “Nimutegure abasoda amajana abiri, abagendera ku mafarasi mirongo indwi, hamwe n’abandi amajana abiri bagwanisha amacumu, mwitegurire kuja i Kayisariya isaha zitatu z’ijoro. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Mutegurire Pawulo amafarasi kugira ngo ashikirizwe Felisi, umukuru w’intara, ata nkomanzi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Aca yandika ikete muri aya majambo:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Jewe Korode Lusiyasi,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Ndakuramukije nyakwubahwa Felisi, umukuru w’intara.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Uwo mugabo ndabarungikiye yari yafashwe na bamwe mu Bayuda, kandi bagira bamwice, maze jewe n’ingabo twari kumwe turahashika turamutabara, kuko nari namenye ko ari Umuroma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Kugira menye ico bamwagiriza, namujanye mu Nama Nkuru y’Abayuda. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nca nsanga bamwagiriza ibijanye n’ivyagezwe vyabo, ariko nta co nasanze kimwagira cotuma ashirwa mw’ibohero canke ngo yicwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Numvise ko bagize inama yo kumwica, nca mpitamwo kumubarungikira ubwo nyene, kandi nategetse ko abamwagiriza babazanira ibirego bamurega.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ba basoda baca bakora nk’uko bategetswe, bajana Pawulo mw’ijoro, bamushikana ahitwa Antipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ku musi ukurikira, abasoda bagendera hasi basubira mw’ikambi, abagendera ku mafarasi baba ari bo babandanya baherekeza Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Bashitse i Kayisariya, bashikiriza rya kete wa mukuru w’intara, bongera bamushikiriza na Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Wa mukuru w’intara arisomye, aca abaza Pawulo iyo ava. Yumvise ko ava i Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />aca amubwira ati: “Nzokwumviriza urubanza rwawe abakwagiriza nibashika.” Aca ategeka ko Pawulo arindirwa ku kirimba kwa Herode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo acirwa urubanza imbere ya Felisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Haciye imisi itanu, umuherezi mukuru Ananiya amanuka i Kayisariya ari kumwe n’abatware n’umucamanza yitwa Teritulo, bazana ibirego barega Pawulo kuri wa mukuru w’intara. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Pawulo arengukijwe, Teritulo atangura kumwagiriza avuga ati: “Nyakwubahwa, tumaze igihe kirekire turi mu mahoro kubera intwaro yawe nziza, kandi ubwenge bwawe bwatumye hahinduka vyinshi mu gihugu cacu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Muri vyose na hose ga nyakwubahwa Felisi, turabigushimira bivuye ku mutima. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ariko ntiriwe ndakwicisha amajambo, ndakwinginze utugirire ubuntu utwumvirize akanya gato.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Twasanze uwu mugabo ari inkozi y’ikibi. Agumura Abayuda aho bari hose kw’isi akabatera kugarariza. Ni we arongoye idini ry’ubuzimire ry’Abanazareti, <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />kandi yagerageje no guhumanya urusengero, maze turamufata. [Twashaka kumucira urubanza twisunze ivyagezwe vyacu, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />ariko Lusiyasi umukuru w’abasoda araza amudushikura mu maboko ku nguvu, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />ategeka ko abamwagiriza baza kukwitura.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note> Nawe niwamwibariza uraza gusanga ivyo tumwagiriza ari ukuri.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Maze abandi Bayuda baca bahuriza hamwe mu kwemeza ko ivyo Teritulo avuze vyose ari ukuri.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Wa mukuru w’intara ahaye ijambo Pawulo ngo avuge, yiregura avuga ati: “Ndazi ko haheze imyaka myinshi ucira imanza abo muri iki gihugu; ni co gituma nezerejwe no kwiregura imbere yawe. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />N’aho wotohoza, wosanga ata misi cumi n’ibiri iheze ngiye i Yerusalemu gusenga. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Aba bariko baranyagiriza ntibigeze basanga ndiko ndaharira n’umuntu n’umwe, canke ngo ngumure abantu haba mu rusengero, mu masinagogi, canke ahandi aho ari ho hose muri ico gisagara. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Aba bantu ntibashobora kwerekana ivyemeza ivyo bariko baranyagiriza. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ariko ndemera ko nsenga Imana ya ba sogokuruza nkurikiza inzira, abo bise idini ry’ubuzimire. Nizera ibihwanye n’ivyo Ivyagezwe vyigisha vyose hamwe n’ivyanditswe mu bitabu vy’abavugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mfise ivyizigiro mu Mana, co kimwe n’ivyo aba bantu bafise, ko hazobaho ukuzuka kw’abagororotsi n’abanyakibi. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ni co gituma nkora ibishoboka vyose kugira namane umutima utanyagiriza ikibi na kimwe imbere y’Imana n’imbere y’abantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Inyuma y’imyaka myinshi ndi mu mahanga, nagarutse i Yerusalemu nzaniye imfashanyo abakene, nje no gutanga ibimazi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Igihe bansanga mu rusengero, nari mu migirwa y’ukwihumanura. Nta bantu benshi twari kumwe kandi nta muvurungano wari uhari. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ariko hari bamwe mu Bayuda bo muri Aziya. Ni bo bari kuza imbere yawe bakagira ico bavuze hamwe boba bafise ico banyagiriza. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Canke abari ngaha, nibavuge icaha basanze kinyagira igihe narengutswa imbere y’Inama Nkuru y’Abayuda, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />uretse iki kimwe ko nasemereye mpagaze imbere yabo mvuga nti: ‘Aha ndiko ncirwa urubanza kuko nizera ko hariho ukuzuka kw’abapfuye.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Maze Felisi, yari asanzwe azi neza ivy’iyo Nzira, aca yungururiza urubanza ku rindi sango, avuga ati: “Lusiyasi umukuru w’abasoda niyaza nzoheza ndabacire urubanza.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Nuko ategeka umukuru w’abasoda ijana kuguma arinze Pawulo, ariko amuhe umwidegemvyo kandi yemerere n’abagenzi biwe kumufasha mu vyo yokenera.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Haheze imisi myinshi, Felisi azanana n’umugore wiwe Durusila, yari Umuyudakazi, atumako Pawulo kugira ngo amwumvirize avuga ivy’ukwizera Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Pawulo ariko aravuga ivyerekeye ukugororoka, ukwirinda n’urubanza rugiye kuza, Felisi aca aratinya, aca amubwira ati: “Niwigire, ivyo biramaze. Ninaronka akandi karyo keza nzosubira ndagutumeko.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Kubera yari yiteze ko Pawulo ashobora kumuha igiturire, yama amutumako kenshi bakaganira.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Haheze imyaka ibiri, Felisi asubirirwa na Porukiyo Fesitusi, ariko kubera Felisi yagomba kunezereza Abayuda, asiga adakuye Pawulo mw’ibohero.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo aburana imbere ya Fesitusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Inyuma y’imisi itatu Fesitusi ashitse i Kayisariya, aca aduga i Yerusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />abonana n’abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abatware b’Abayuda, na bo bamushikiriza ivyo barega Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Maze binginga Fesitusi ngo abagirire neza mu kwemera kwimurira Pawulo i Yerusalemu. Ivyo vyaterwa n’uko bari baramaze gutegura ingene boca bamutegerera mu nzira bakamwica. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesitusi arabishura ati: “Pawulo apfungiwe i Kayisariya, kandi nanje ndi mu gusubirayo vuba. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Nihagire bamwe mu barongozi banyu baza tujane, bamwagiririze hariya, nimba hari ikibi yakoze.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Nuko amarana na bo imisi umunani hanyuma asubira i Kayisariya. Ku musi ukurikira, akoranya abacamanza, maze arengutsa Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Pawulo arengutse, Abayuda bari bamanutse bava i Yerusalemu baramukikuza, bamwagiriza ivyaha bihambaye badashobora kuronkera ivyemezo.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Maze Pawulo na we ariregura, avuga ati: “Sinigeze ncumura ku vyagezwe vy’Abayuda, canke ku rusengero, canke kuri Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Kubera Fesitusi yagomba gushimisha Abayuda, aca abaza Pawulo ati: “Uriteguye kuduga i Yerusalemu kugira ngo uburanire imbere yanje hariya?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pawulo arishura ati: “Ubu mpagaze imbere y’ubucamanza bwa Kayisari, kandi ni ho ntegerezwa kuburanira. Nta caha nokoreye Abayuda nk’uko na we ubizi neza. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nimba hari icaha na kimwe kinyagira cotuma nicwa, sinanse gupfa. Ariko nimba ivyo bariko baranyagiriza atari vyo, nta n’umwe afise uburenganzira bwo kunshira mu maboko y’aba Bayuda. Nsavye ko urubanza rwanje rwungururizwa kwa Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesitusi amaze gukebukana n’abajenama biwe, aca avuga ati: “Ko witwaye kwa Kayisari, uzoburanira kwa Kayisari.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fesitusi na Agiripa bavugana ivya Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Haheze imisi mikeya umwami Agiripa ashika i Kayisariya ari kumwe na Berenise baje gukeza Fesitusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Kubera bamaze imisi myinshi ngaho, Fesitusi aca aronka akaryo ko kuganira n’uwo mwami ivya Pawulo. Avuga ati: “Hano hari umugabo Felisi yasize ari imbohe. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Igihe naja i Yerusalemu, abaherezi bakurubakuru n’abakuru b’Abayuda, baramwitwariye bashaka ko ndamutsindisha.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Nababwiye ko bitari mu migenzo y’Abaroma gucira urubanza umuntu adahawe umwanya wo kuburana n’abamwitwariye ngo aronke akaryo ko kwiregura ku vyo bamwagiriza. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Abamwagiriza bashitse hano, sinatebeje urubanza, ku musi ukurikira, naciye nicara ku ntebe y’imanza, ndengutsa n’uwo mugabo. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Abamwagiriza barahagurutse ngo bavuge, ntibamwagirije icaha na kimwe mu vyo nari niteze. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ariko bari bafise ivyo bapfa na we bijanye n’idini ryabo hamwe n’umugabo yapfuye yitwa Yesu, ariko Pawulo we yemeza ko ari muzima. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Jewe sinabona uko noca urwo rubanza, ni co gituma nasavye ko Pawulo yoja i Yerusalemu kugira ngo uburanire yo kuri ivyo bamwagiriza. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ariko Pawulo we yasavye ko urubanza rwiwe rwokwungururizwa kwa Kayisari, naciye ntegeka ko aguma apfungiwe ngaha gushika ndamurungitse.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agiripa aca abwira Fesitusi ati: “Nanje ndashaka kwiyumvira uwo muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Aramwishura ati: “Ejo uzomwiyumvira.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo arenguka imbere ya Agiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ku musi ukurikira, Agiripa na Berenise baza bari kumwe n’abagendanyi benshi, binjira muri sentare baherekejwe n’abasoda bakurubakuru hamwe n’abubahwa bo muri ico gisagara. Fesitusi aca ategeka ko bazana Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesitusi avuga ati: “Mwami Agiripa, namwe mwese mukoraniye ngaha, murabona uwu mugabo! Abayuda bose baranyitwayeko bambwira ivyiwe haba i Yerusalemu canke ngaha i Kayisariya, basemerera ko adakwiye kwongera kubaho. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mugabo, jewe nasanze ata kintu na kimwe yakoze cotuma yicwa, ariko kubera yamaze gusaba ko urubanza rwiwe rwungururizwa kwa Kayisari, nahisemwo kuzomurungika i Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ariko nabuze ikintu gifadika nandikira Kayisari cerekeye uwu muntu. Ni co gituma namuzanye ngaha imbere yanyu mwese, na canecane imbere yawe mwami Agiripa, kugira ngo tumaze gutohoza ivyiwe, ndonke ico nandikira Kayisari. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ntibibereye ko ndungika imbohe nterekanye ico yagirizwa.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiripa na we abarira Pawulo ati: “Urahawe uburenganzira bwo kwiregura.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Pawulo aca aramvura ukuboko, atangura kwiregura, avuga ati: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Mwami Agiripa, ngiriwe ubuntu bwo guhagarara imbere yawe uno musi, niregura ku vyo nagirizwa n’Abayuda, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />na canecane ko wewe usanzwe uzi neza imigenzo y’Abayuda n’impari zabo. None rero ndakwinginze unyumvirize wihanganye.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Abayuda bose barazi ingene nabayeho kuva nkiri umwana, ingene nakuze haba mu gihugu navukiyemwo canke i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Baranzi neza kuva kera, kandi bashatse bobishingira intahe ko nabayeho nk’umwe mu Bafarisayo, umuce urusha iyindi mu gushimikira ku migenzo y’idini ryacu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kandi igitumye mpagaze imbere y’ubucamanza uwu musi, ni kubera nizigiye ivyo Imana yasezeraniye ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Ivyo ni vyo imiryango yacu cumi n’ibiri yiteze kubona bishika; ni co gituma bakorera Imana n’umwete mwinshi ijoro n’umurango. Kandi ga mwami, ivyo vyizigiro nyene ni vyo bituma Abayuda banshengeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Mbega ni kuki muri mwebwe hari abibaza ko bidashoboka ko Imana izura abapfuye?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Nanje ubwanje nahora niyumvira ko nkwiye gukora ibishoboka vyose ngo ngwanye izina rya Yesu Umunyanazareti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Kandi ivyo narabikoze i Yerusalemu. Nahawe ububasha n’abaherezi bakurubakuru bwo gufata abizera no kubata mw’ibohero; kandi mu kubacira urwo gupfa, nari mu bavyemeza. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Kenshi nava mw’isinagogi nja mu yindi nkabakubitisha, nkabategeka gutuka izina rya Yesu. Muri ukwo kwuzura ishaka ribi nyene ryo kubagwanya, nashitse no mu bisagara vyo mu mahanga kubahama no kubahigayo.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Umusi umwe nari ngiye muri ivyo bikorwa nyene i Damasiko, nari nahawe ububasha kandi ntumwe n’abaherezi bakurubakuru. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Maze ga mwami, nko kw’isaha ya gatandatu y’umurango, ndi mu nzira ngenda, mbona umuco mwinshi uva mw’ijuru, uruta uw’izuba, uturasira impande zose twe n’abo twari kumwe. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Twese duca tugwa hasi, maze numva ijwi rimbarira mu Giheburayo riti: <char style="wj">‘Sawuli, Sawuli, uriko umpamira iki? Wibabariza ubusa kuko uriko utera imigere ku macumu.’</char><verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Nanje nca ndamubaza nti: ‘Uri nde ga Mwami?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">Na we ati: <char style="wj">‘Ndi Yesu uwo uriko urahama.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" /><char style="wj">None rero va hasi uhagarare, kuko ndakwiyeretse kugira ngo ndagutume nk’umukozi wanje, kandi nk’icabona co gushingira intahe ivyo wambonyeko n’ivyo nzokwereka.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" /><char style="wj">Nzokurokora mu maboko y’ubwoko bwawe no mu maboko y’Abanyamahanga, abo ndagutumyemwo,</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" /><char style="wj">kugira ngo ubugurure amaso, bave mu mwijima baje mu muco, ubakure mu bubasha bwa Satani ubazane ku Mana, baharirwe ivyaha vyabo, maze bahabwe ikibanza mu bejejwe babihawe no kunyizera.’</char><verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />None rero Mwami Agiripa, numviye ivyo neretswe bivuye mw’ijuru. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Natanguriye kubwira ab’i Damasiko, hanyuma nja mu b’i Yerusalemu n’i Yudaya hose, ntibagiye no mu Banyamahanga, nigisha ko bakwiye kwihana bakagaruka ku Mana, kandi bagakora ibikorwa bikwiranye n’ukwihana kwabo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ico ni co catumye Abayuda bamfatira mu rusengero bakagomba kunyica. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ariko Imana yagumye indinda gushika uwu musi. None mpagaze ngaha nshingira intahe abakuru n’abato. Nta co ndiko ndavuga kirengeye ivyo abavugishwa n’Imana na Mose bavuze ko bizoshika, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />ko Kristo akwiye kubabazwa, akaba impfura mu kuzuka mu bapfuye, maze akamamaza umuco mu bwoko bwiwe no mu Banyamahanga.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ageze aho, Fesitusi aca amuciramwo arasemerera ati: “Erega Pawulo wasaze! Ivyigwa vyinshi wize vyaragusarishije.”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pawulo asubizayo ati: “Nyenicubahiro Fesitusi, sinasaze. Ivyo ndiko ndavuga ni ukuri kandi biratahuritse. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Ibi umwami asanzwe abizi. Ibi ndiko ndabivuga nshize ubwoba kuko ndazi ko na we nyene abizi, kuko ntivyakorewe mu kinyegero. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mwami Agiripa, mbega ntiwizera ivyo abavugishwa bavuze? Ndazi ko uvyizera.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa aca abaza Pawulo ati: “Wibaza ko mu kanya gato nk’aka woshobora kunyemeza nkaba Umukristo?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pawulo asubizayo ati: “Umwanya waba muto canke munini, nta co bitwaye. Ico nsaba Imana ni uko atoba wewe gusa, ariko n’abariko baranyumviriza bose uwu musi bomera nkanje, uretse kuba muri iyi minyororo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Umwami, umukuru w’intara na Berenise n’abari bicaranye na bo baca barahaguruka, baragenda. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Bavuye muri iyo sentare, bagenda baraganira, bavuga bati: “Uwu muntu nta co yakoze cotuma yicwa canke ngo ashirwe mw’ibohero.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiripa abarira Fesitusi ati: “Iyaba atari yaramaze kwungururiza kwa Kayisari, yaca arekurwa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo Ajanwa i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Bamaze gufata ingingo ko tuja mu Butaliyano n’ubwato, Pawulo be n’izindi mbohe bashikirizwa umukuru w’abasoda ijana yitwa Juliyusi, yari umwe mu basoda bakuru bo mu muce w’abacungera ubuzima bwa Kayisari. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Nuko twurira ubwato bwava muri Aduramutiyo bugaca ku bivuko vyo mu ntara ya Aziya, turagenda. Kandi Arisitariko Umunyamakedoniya w’i Tesalonike twari kumwe.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ku musi ukurikira twururukira i Sidoni. Pawulo agira ikiganza ciza kuri Juliyusi, amwemerera kuja ku bagenzi biwe kugira ngo bamufashe mu vyo akeneye. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tuvuye aho, duca tugendera hafi y’izinga rya Kupuro kugira ngo twikingire umuyaga kuko wari uduturutse imbere. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Tumaze kurengana akarere kari hagati ya Kilikiya na Pamfiliya, duca twururukira i Mura muri Lukiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Wa mukuru w’abasoda ijana aca asanga hari ubwato bwo muri Alegizanderiya buja mu Butaliyano, aca arabutwuriza. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Nuko tumara imisi itari mike tugenda bukebuke, dushika i Kinida bitugoye cane. Umuyaga utubujije kubandanya, duca tugenda twegereye uruhande rw’izinga rya Kireti rurabana n’i Salumone kugira ngo twikingire umuyaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nuko tugenda twisunze urwo ruhande bitugoye, dushika ahantu hitwa Ibivuko Vyiza, hafi y’igisagara citwa Laseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Aho twahataye umwanya munini, kandi kubandanya urugendo kwari nk’ukwiheba kuko hari inyuma y’umusi mukuru w’impongano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uwo musi mukuru witwa Yomu Kipuru. Bawuhimbaza mu mpera z’ukwezi kw’icenda canke mu ntango z’ukw’icumi. Muri ico gihe, ingendo zo mu kiyaga zabamwo impanuka nyinshi kubera imiyaga n’imbeho.</char></note>. Pawulo aburira abantu ati: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Bagenzi, ndabona ko uru rugendo ruja kubamwo ingorane nyinshi, n’ubuhombe bwinshi ku bwato, ku vyo butwaye, ndetse no ku buzima bwacu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ariko wa mukuru w’abasoda ijana aho kwumviriza Pawulo, yumviriza uwugendesha ubwato na nyenebwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kubera bitari vyoroshe kumara muri ico kivuko igihe cose c’imbeho nyinshi cane cari kigiye kuza, benshi mu bari mu bwato bahitamwo ko twobandanya, kugira ngo bishobotse tumare ico gihe i Foyinike. Foyinike cari ikivuko c’i Kireti caraba mu bumanuko bushira uburengero no mu buraruko bushira uburengero.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igihuhusi mu kiyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Akayaga gakeya gaturuka mu bumanuko gahuhuse, baca bibaza ko urugendo ruja kugenda neza. Baca batangura gusoza bagendera hafi y’izinga rya Kireti. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Tutarashika kure, haduka igihuhusi gikomeye citwa Ewulakuloni kiza giturutse kuri iryo zinga. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Maze ubwato butangirwa n’umuyaga, ntivyakunda ko bubandanya. Duca turareka umuyaga udutwara iyo ushaka. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Duca tugenda twegereye izinga rito ryitwa Kawuda kugira ngo dushobore kwikinga umuyaga, twiyegereza akato ko kwifashisha mu gihe c’impanuka bitugoye cane. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bamaze kukaduza mu bwato, baca bakabohesha imigozi. Kubera batinya ko bwohava bubajana mu musenyi ushaya w’ahitwa Suriti muri Libiya, baca barekurira mu kiyaga icuma kiremereye kiboheye ku migozi, hanyuma barareka umuyaga ukubeba ubwato ubujana iyo ushaka. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Nuko tuba muri ako kaga ko kuzungagizwa n’ibihuhusi kugeza aho ku musi ukurikira batangura guta mu mazi bimwe mu vyari mu bwato. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Ku musi ugira gatatu, bo nyene baterera mu mazi ibikoresho bimwebimwe ubwato bukenera. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Haheze imisi myinshi ata zuba canke inyenyeri tubonye, kandi imipfunda iguma isuriranya, tugera aho dutakaza ivyizigiro vyo gukira.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Haheze igihe abantu ata co barya, Pawulo ahagarara imbere yabo avuga ati: “Bagenzi, mwari mukwiye kunyumviriza, mukareka kuva i Kireti. Gutyo mwari kuba mwirinze aka kaga n’uru ruhombo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ubu rero ndabasavye mugumye imitima, kuko ata n’umwe muri mwebwe azotakaza ubuzima; ubwato bwonyene ni bwo buzosaba. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Muri iri joro nyene, umumarayika w’Imana nitirirwa kandi nkorera, yampagaze i ruhande <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ambarira ati: ‘Ntutinye Pawulo we! Utegerezwa kuzoburanira imbere ya Kayisari; kandi kubera wewe, Imana izozigama ubuzima bw’abo muri kumwe bose.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nuko rero bagenzi, nimugumye imitima, kuko ndizera ko Imana izobishitsa nk’uko yabimbwiye. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ariko rero, hariho izinga rimwe ubu ubwato buzosabirako.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwato busaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Mw’ijoro ry’umusi ugira cumi na kane, twari tugikubebwa n’umuyaga mu Kiyaga ca Adiriya. Nko mu gicugu, abagendesha ubwato bumva ko umenga turegereje umusozi. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bagera uburebure bw’amazi gushika hasi musi y’ubwato, basanga ni nk’ingero ijana na mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 37.</char></note>. Haheze akanya barasubira basanga ni nk’ingero mirongo icenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Batinye ko ubwato bwohava bwiseka ku mabuye, baca barekurira mu mazi ivyuma bine biremereye biboheye ku migozi bibuza ubwato kugenda bibohewe ku bwato inyuma, bipfuza kubona bukeye. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Maze abatwara ubwato bagerageza gutoroka ngo babuvemwo, bururutsa ka kato ko kwifashisha mu gihe c’impanuka, babesha ngo bagiye kurekurira mu mazi ivyuma vy’imbere na vyo. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Maze Pawulo abwira wa mukuru w’abasoda ijana ati: “Abo batagumye mu bwato ntimushobora kurokoka.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Maze abasoda baca bacagagura imigozi yari iboshe ako kato gaca gakorokera mu kiyaga karatwarwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Bugiye guca, Pawulo yinginga abantu bose ngo bagire ico barya. Ababwira ati: “Raba haciye imisi cumi n’ine mwihebuye ata co mutamira. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />None rero ndabasavye murabe ico murya, kugira ngo mubeho; kuko nta n’umwe muri mwebwe azotakaza n’agashatsi ko ku mutwe wiwe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Avuze ivyo, afata umukate awushimira Imana imbere yabo, arawumanyagura, aca atangura kurya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Bose baca bararema, na bo batangura kurya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Abari muri ubwo bwato twese hamwe twari abantu amajana abiri na mirongo indwi na batandatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bamaze kurya bagahaga, baca bata ingano mu kiyaga kugira ngo baremurure ubwato.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Bukeye ntibashobora kumenya iyo ntara barimwo iyo ari yo, ariko babonye ahantu hari umusenyi ku nkengera y’ikiyaga, bafata ingingo yo gutumberezayo ubwato ngo babuhagarikeyo hamwe bibashobokeye. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Nuko bacagagura ya migozi yari ifashe vya vyuma, babirekurira mu mazi, babohora n’imigozi yari iboshe ingafe, baduza igihuzu c’imbere kugira ngo umuyaga usunike ubwato ubujana imbere, basoza batumbereye ku musenyi wo ku nkengera. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ariko ubwato buca bwiseka mu musenyi mwinshi burahagarara, umutwe wabwo uruma mu musenyi, igihande c’inyuma na co kirasaba kubera imipfunda yacisekako n’inkomezi nyinshi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Abasoda baca baja inama yo kwica imbohe zose kugira ngo ntihagire izoga ngo zihunge zibacike. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ariko kubera wa mukuru w’abasoda ijana yashaka gukingira Pawulo, ababuza kubikora. Aca ategeka ko abazi kwoga bobanza bagasimbira mu mazi bagashika impore i musozi. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Abasigaye baca bogera ku mbaho n’ibimanyu vy’ubwato, gutyo bose bashika impore i musozi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Dushika kw’izinga ryitwa Malita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Tumaze kurokoka impore tugashika ku musenyi, duca tumenya ko iryo zinga ryitwa Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Abantu baba kuri ryo batwakirana ubugwaneza budasanzwe, baducanira umucanwa kuko imvura yariko iragwa kandi hari hakanye. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Maze Pawulo yegeranya umukama w’inkwi awushira ku muriro, haca havamwo inzoka y’ikimata ibabuwe n’uwo muriro imukomora ku kuboko kandi ikumatako. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Abantu bo muri iryo zinga babonye ico kiyoka cenena ku kuboko kwiwe, barabwirana bati: “Uwu muntu ategerezwa kuba ari umwicanyi, kuko raba n’aho yari akize ikiyaga, ubutungane bwo ntibumwereye ko abaho.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Pawulo aca akunkumurira ico kiyoka mu muriro, kandi ubumara bwaco ntibwagira ico bumugira. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Abantu bari biteze ko aca avyimba canke agapfa ubwo nyene. Ariko barindiriye umwanya muremure bakabona nta co abaye, baca barahindura batangura kuvuga ko Pawulo ari imana.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Hafi y’aho hari itongo ry’umukuru w’iryo zinga yitwa Pubiliyo. Na we atwakirana ubugwaneza, aduha indaro, tuhamara imisi itatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Se wa Pubiliyo yari agwaye inyonko n’amacinya, arembeye ku buriri. Nuko Pawulo yinjira aho ari aramusengera amurambitseko ibiganza, aca arakira. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ivyo bibaye, abarwayi bose bo kuri iryo zinga baca baraza Pawulo arabasengera, barakira. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Maze ivyo bibaye, baduha icubahiro cinshi, hanyuma hageze ko tugenda badutekerera ivyo tuzokenera vyose mu rugendo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dushika i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Tuhamaze amezi atatu, duca twurira ubwato bwava muri Alegizanderiya bwari bwabujijwe kubandanya urugendo n’igihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane. Umutwe wabwo wariko ikimenyetso c’ibigirwamana vy’amahasa bibiri vyitwa Kasitori na Polugisi. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Dushitse i Sirakusi tuhamara imisi itatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Tuhavuye, twaciye tubandanya dushika i Regiyo. Bukeye, umuyaga w’i bumanuko urahuhuta, maze mu misi ibiri tubona gushika i Puteyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Aho twahasanze bene Data, baca baratwakira badusaba ko twomarana na bo imisi indwi. Hanyuma turabandanya dushika i Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Maze Bene Data baho bumvise ko dushitse, baca baraza badusanganirira ku Kaguriro kari kw’ibarara ryitiriwe Apiyusi, abandi badusanga ku Nzu Zitatu z’Ingenzi. Pawulo ababonye ashima Imana kandi ararema mu mutima. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Dushitse i Roma, Pawulo ahabwa uruhusha rwo kuba mu nzu ya wenyene, ari kumwe n’umusoda amucunze.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yigishiriza i Roma ari imbohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Haheze imisi itatu, Pawulo atumako abarongozi b’Abayuda baho. Bamaze gukorana, Pawulo arababwira ati: “Bavukanyi, naho ata kibi nakoreye ubwoko bwacu canke ngo ndenge ku migenzo ya sogokuruza, ndi i Yerusalemu narafashwe, nshirwa mu minwe y’Abaroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bamaze gutohoza neza ivyanje, bipfuza kundekura kuko ata kibi na kimwe canyagira cari gutuma nicwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Maze mbonye ko Abayuda banse ingingo yo kundekura, nca nitwara kuri Kayisari. Ariko ntivyari bitumwe nuko ngomvye kuburanya ubwoko bwanje. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ni co gituma nabinginze ngo muze kugira ngo tuganire, ndabamenyeshe ko mbohewe ivyizigiro ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli bwari bwiteze.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Baca baramwishura bati: “Nta kete na rimwe twigeze turonka rivuye i Yudaya rivuga ivyawe, kandi nta wo muri benewacu n’umwe yaje ava hariya ngo atubwire ikibi na kimwe kuri wewe. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ariko twashaka kukwiyumvira utubwire ivyo wizera, kuko turazi ko ahantu hose bavuga nabi uwo mugwi w’idini urimwo.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Baca bashinga uwundi musi bazobonanirako, hanyuma baza ari benshi bamusanga mu nzu yabamwo. Kuva mu gitondo gushika mw’ijoro, arabasigurira yongera abemeza ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana, agerageza kubatahuza ivya Yesu Kristo akoresheje ibitabu vy’Ivyagezwe vya Mose n’ivy’abavugishwa n’Imana. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bamwe bemera ivyo ababariye, abandi banka kuvyizera. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nuko hagera ko bataha bagiharira, hanyuma Pawulo ababwira ijambo ryo kubasezera ati: “Mpwemu Yera yavuga ukuri igihe yavuga kuri ba sogokuruza banyu, avugishije Yesaya ati:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Genda ubwire ubwo bwoko uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Kwumva muzokwama mwumva ariko ntimuzokwigera mutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">kuraba muzokwama muraba ariko ntimuzokwigera mubona.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kuko imitima y’ubu bwoko ikomantaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">amatwi yabo ntashobora kwumva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kandi amaso yabo barayahumiriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ahandi ho bobonesheje amaso yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">bakumvisha amatwi yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">bagatahurisha imitima yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">maze bagahindukira nanje nkabakiza.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Yesaya 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Nuko rero nimumenye ko ako gakiza k’Imana n’Abanyamahanga bagashikirijwe, kandi bo bazokakira.” [ <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Abayuda bumvise ayo majambo, basubira inyuma bayaharirako cane.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pawulo aca amara imyaka ibiri yibana mu nzu akose, akama yakira abaza kumuraba bose. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Yama yigisha ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana n’ivya Yesu Kristo, ashize amanga rwose kandi ata ntambamyi.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>